{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":87,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":18076,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1608725,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1334762225,"LastPoster":{"Id":269788,"Name":"Tinkerbell82","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":97,"Preview":{"Id":1608725,"PostDate":1334762225,"PostContent":"\u00a0  - January 2, 2012 -\u00a0  I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited to start this wedding planning blog. Those close to me...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b8e45a18deceef6b03a3ea2877e735c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;em&gt;- January 2, 2012 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited to start this wedding planning blog. Those close to me know I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve been planning this wedding since Raoul started calling me regularly. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve been driving everyone around me crazy with my plans and&amp;nbsp;buying stuff for the wedding. I had to endure them telling me to hold on to make sure we are really getting married. Well now it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s official!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I guess I should start with a formal introduction (because I hope to have more readers than just my mother) I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m Amber Dominique, a&amp;nbsp;dreamer who strives to&amp;nbsp;gain as many talents as she possibly can. I love eating \u00e2\u20ac\u0153good\u00e2\u20ac\u009d food, caring for&amp;nbsp;children, being a part of my American Sign Language congregation,&amp;nbsp;old movies &amp;amp; fashions, country&amp;nbsp;music&amp;nbsp;and most of all the love of my life \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Raoul.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-18\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/my_ra1.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"my_ra\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;(Us on Jaws Beach \u00e2\u20ac\u201c right after he proposed)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;Raoul&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;just like me in all the ways it counts and opposite in all the ways&amp;nbsp;that make us work as a team. If you would\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve asked me everyday up until I fell for him I never would have said I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d end up marrying a man from a different country. But that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s what\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s happening!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m marrying a man who\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s admired and respected by me as well as his family and friends. I love that he doesn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind being my best friend and lets me talk all night, he\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s always determined to improve&amp;nbsp;on himself and our relationship, he has high standards and a great big heart that loves me!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-19 aligncenter\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/us_1.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Us in a Cave in Nassau\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;(Us in a Cave in Nassau \u00e2\u20ac\u201c April 2011)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We met in The Bahamas October 2009 when I was there on a cruise with family and friends. He might call it something else but the way he described it to me, he fell in love at first sight. After his relentless and charming efforts we started dating shortly after in December. Two years,&amp;nbsp;thousands of phone minutes,&amp;nbsp;six plane rides, and&amp;nbsp;tons of hugs, kisses and tears later I made a decision.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-20\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/traveling.jpg?w=245&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"traveling\" width=\"245\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;(We didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t actually fly direct but you get the idea)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We are supposed to get married \u00e2\u20ac\u201c seriously. Because we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re not exactly a car ride away, Raoul FINALLY asked me to marry him over the phone and I had to wait a long, long, long (well it felt that long) time till we could be together again and he could put a ring on it!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-21\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/my_ring.jpg?w=218&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"my_ring\" width=\"218\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; (Showing off my prized possesion) All photos unless sourced are personal&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;I always wanted to&amp;nbsp;get married on&amp;nbsp;a beach and once I started dreaming about marrying Ra all I could think was&amp;nbsp;how amazing would it be to get married where the beaches are&amp;nbsp;among some of the most beautiful in the world!&amp;nbsp;So despite everyone trying to&amp;nbsp;convince me a wedding in the states would be easier\/cheaper\/more convenient&amp;nbsp;we are getting married in The Beautiful Bahamas! Together we are planning a very elegant, slightly vintage, all DIY, as green as possible destination wedding on the beach in Nassau and a reception&amp;nbsp;in the woods in Virginia&amp;nbsp;Beach&amp;nbsp;with a little bit of money and a whole lotta love!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"ilikeposts\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.128906); width: 560px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608725,"PostDate":1334762225,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <em>- January 2, 2012 -\u00a0<\/em><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited to start this wedding planning blog. Those close to me know I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve been planning this wedding since Raoul started calling me regularly. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve been driving everyone around me crazy with my plans and\u00a0buying stuff for the wedding. I had to endure them telling me to hold on to make sure we are really getting married. Well now it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s official!<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I guess I should start with a formal introduction (because I hope to have more readers than just my mother) I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m Amber Dominique, a\u00a0dreamer who strives to\u00a0gain as many talents as she possibly can. I love eating \u00e2\u20ac\u0153good\u00e2\u20ac\u009d food, caring for\u00a0children, being a part of my American Sign Language congregation,\u00a0old movies & fashions, country\u00a0music\u00a0and most of all the love of my life \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Raoul.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-18\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/my_ra1.jpg?w=300&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"my_ra\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0(Us on Jaws Beach \u00e2\u20ac\u201c right after he proposed)<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0Raoul\u00a0is\u00a0just like me in all the ways it counts and opposite in all the ways\u00a0that make us work as a team. If you would\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve asked me everyday up until I fell for him I never would have said I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d end up marrying a man from a different country. But that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s what\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s happening!\u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m marrying a man who\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s admired and respected by me as well as his family and friends. I love that he doesn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t mind being my best friend and lets me talk all night, he\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s always determined to improve\u00a0on himself and our relationship, he has high standards and a great big heart that loves me!\u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-19 aligncenter\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/us_1.jpg?w=300&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Us in a Cave in Nassau\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0(Us in a Cave in Nassau \u00e2\u20ac\u201c April 2011)<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> We met in The Bahamas October 2009 when I was there on a cruise with family and friends. He might call it something else but the way he described it to me, he fell in love at first sight. After his relentless and charming efforts we started dating shortly after in December. Two years,\u00a0thousands of phone minutes,\u00a0six plane rides, and\u00a0tons of hugs, kisses and tears later I made a decision.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-20\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/traveling.jpg?w=245&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"traveling\" width=\"245\" \/><\/span>\u00a0(We didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t actually fly direct but you get the idea)<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> We are supposed to get married \u00e2\u20ac\u201c seriously. Because we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re not exactly a car ride away, Raoul FINALLY asked me to marry him over the phone and I had to wait a long, long, long (well it felt that long) time till we could be together again and he could put a ring on it!\u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-21\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/my_ring.jpg?w=218&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"my_ring\" width=\"218\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> (Showing off my prized possesion) All photos unless sourced are personal<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0I always wanted to\u00a0get married on\u00a0a beach and once I started dreaming about marrying Ra all I could think was\u00a0how amazing would it be to get married where the beaches are\u00a0among some of the most beautiful in the world!\u00a0So despite everyone trying to\u00a0convince me a wedding in the states would be easier\/cheaper\/more convenient\u00a0we are getting married in The Beautiful Bahamas! Together we are planning a very elegant, slightly vintage, all DIY, as green as possible destination wedding on the beach in Nassau and a reception\u00a0in the woods in Virginia\u00a0Beach\u00a0with a little bit of money and a whole lotta love!<\/p> <div id=\"ilikeposts\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\"  style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"> <div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 12px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"129ef0a7323da960972e8d9f0ac80f74","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our History: Boy Meets Girl&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;January 4, 2010&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; I love when Raoul tells the story of how we met. It involves him praying for a wife to come into his life, nearly falling in love at first sight and calling his friend all day to figure out how to spend time getting to know me. But to get him to tell this story is not easy. I on the other hand love telling stories. And so here is my version of how Raoul and I met:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; In October 2009&amp;nbsp;I went on a cruise with my Mom, Grandma and Aunt Roz and a group of friends. Mamma Law had contacted Raoul whom she had known from a previous trip to host the tour. We were docked&amp;nbsp;in Nassau for two days. I was sick and didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t go the first night to the meeting and Aunt Roz stayed back with me. When Mommy and Grandma came back they kept telling me about this great guy they found for me that I have to meet. Of course I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t interest in someone from another country so I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t concerned. The next day we set out on the tour and Mommy was talking about this guy who was going to be her \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Winston.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I was distracted trying to get mommy\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s slip to stay up on me (it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t until we&amp;nbsp;got in the sun&amp;nbsp;I realized my dress was see-through.) Mommy introduced me to&amp;nbsp;Raoul and I quickly went back to focusing on my slip before I even&amp;nbsp;held eye contact. People started getting into the four vans they had for us. I would have been in Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s van but no one wanted to separate their family so&amp;nbsp; Mommy volunteered us, and Grandma&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Aunt Roz went with Raoul and Mommy&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; I jumped in another van. All day I barely noticed Raoul, mainly because I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t know what he looked like. Until reminded me later, I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t remember he came to find out inside Atlantis when we were seperated from the group. I do remember me sitting on the ground talking to him outside Atlantis about the weather in Virginia and the colors of our dirty&amp;nbsp;water as we waited for all the vans to arrive&amp;nbsp;so we can leave.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;dl style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;dt style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/bahamas3-069.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=225\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"me_stitting_outside_atlantis\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/dt&gt; &lt;dd style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Me sitting on the ground talking to Raoul outside Atlantis&lt;\/dd&gt; &lt;\/dl&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I remember asking him when we were going to eat at the Queen\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Staircase. (He had no idea then how serious I was about my food) He told us it was ok to eat the hot dogs from a street vendor which made me soooooo sick. He talked to me again&amp;nbsp;when I was feeding and playing with&amp;nbsp;a stray dog, known in The Bahamas as a \u00e2\u20ac\u0153potcake\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and he warned me not to&amp;nbsp;pet him.&amp;nbsp;I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to listen to Raoul, but I listened when my mother told me I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t go back in the country if I touched&amp;nbsp;him.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; As the tour ended, Raoul promised my mom to take her to get a Guinness beer (which isn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t the same as what we have in the states.)A few&amp;nbsp;friends jumped in Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s van and off we went to go get something to eat and&amp;nbsp;go to the beach. Raoul said he would take us to his cousin\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s restaurant at the Fish Fry. While walking there I complained he said \u00e2\u20ac\u0153it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s right here\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and it was actually a long way to walk. I was starving!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t take long for us to feel at home there. We tried local food (like cracked conch and fried snapper) and drinks (like Sky Juice, Kalik and Guinness.) That day&amp;nbsp;I fell in love with&amp;nbsp;their amazing food.&amp;nbsp;We also had dancing lessons from the waitress. I&amp;nbsp;got a strange feeling&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;Raoul was&amp;nbsp;watching me trying to learn to&amp;nbsp;dance but I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t pay it any mind. I&amp;nbsp;was calling&amp;nbsp;Raoul my step dad all&amp;nbsp;afternoon because of the whole&amp;nbsp;\u00e2\u20ac\u009dHow Stella got her Groove back\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&amp;nbsp;thing. We had a great time at that place!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" id=\"attachment_44\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; width: 310px; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-44\" height=\"225\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/bahamas3-107.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=225\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"GroupPhoto\" width=\"300\" \/&gt; &lt;p class=\"wp-caption-text\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(138, 138, 138); text-align: center; \"&gt; Raoul is second from the left and I&#039;m in the middle&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; When we were heading&amp;nbsp;to the car to go to the beach,&amp;nbsp;I realized they threw about my Kalik beer bottle (which I wanted to save for sand). Raoul offered to get me another and walked me to another restaurant on the strip. We argued because he wanted to buy it and of course I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t having it. I remember he made a comment about my eyes and I gave in. I waited outside talking to his buddy Rasta who was making conch salad for two ladies. I noticed the ladies were going crazy over this \u00e2\u20ac\u0153pistol\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and Rasta gave it to them and they swallowed it right up. Rasta offered me one but&amp;nbsp;I declined. (I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not in the habit of putting just anything in my mouth)  Raoul came out from buying the beer and let Rasta drink it so I could have the bottle. While they were swallowing up \u00e2\u20ac\u0153pistols\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I asked Raoul what it was, he told me to try one, I hesitated but he told me not to worry it was safe. I figured \u00e2\u20ac\u0153When in Rome\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and sucked it down for the full Bahamas experience. It was salty and almost slimy. We headed back to everyone waiting at the car and I asked \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Raoul, what was that I just put in my mouth?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d He replied \u00e2\u20ac\u0153A reproductive organ.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d You can imagine the look on my face! I was UP-SET! I told him I thought I could trust him and I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t believe he let me put that in my mouth!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"&gt; &lt;dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-42\" height=\"107\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/3.jpg?w=396&amp;amp;h=107\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Rasta\" width=\"396\" \/&gt;&lt;\/dt&gt; &lt;dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Rasta making the Conch Salad&lt;\/dd&gt; &lt;\/dl&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I told everyone what had just happened as soon as we reached the car and they all wanted to go investigate. So back we went so a few of them could see what I was talking about and try one. I told Raoul I would always remember him for that experience. (I attribute Rasta, Conch salad and Kalik beer to how Raoul and I got together)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"&gt; &lt;dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-41\" height=\"296\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide1.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=296\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ConchPictures\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/dt&gt; &lt;dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; My friend Quianna looking at the pistol before trying it&amp;nbsp;but Mommy wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t eat it&lt;\/dd&gt; &lt;\/dl&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; He dropped us off at the beach and we all gave him our emails and I thought I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d never see or hear from him again. A few weeks later my mom called excited that Raoul had emailed her. I asked her to forward it to me and I noticed he sent it to everyone. I checked my junk folder and there my copy was. There was also another email. He sent me an email asking if I was married because of my hyphenated last name. He explained there had been times he let opportunities go by because he didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t speak up and he regretted that. He asked if he could email and I said it would be ok.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; After a few nice emails he asked if he could call me. I had no idea how hard he worked and how much money he spent to get me on the phone for short conversations. Once he was able to get a magic jack, and call unlimited I was hearing that enticing accent more often than I ever expected. Raoul says it was the fact he was from the Bahamas and I think it was his voice and his intelligence but he won me over and soon my mother was telling everyone I stole her man. I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t tell you when we officially started dating but I could tell you when through texts and emails we said sweet things to one another.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"&gt; &lt;dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-40\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/2654edit1.png?w=200&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ScreenShot\" width=\"200\" \/&gt;&lt;\/dt&gt; &lt;dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Screen Shot from My Phone&lt;\/dd&gt; &lt;\/dl&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; By the end of December I had pretty much figured out that I would fall in love with and marry this man. And the journey began.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Did you know you were going to marry your SO&amp;nbsp;before you started officially started&amp;nbsp;dating? Do you believe in love at first sight?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"ilikeposts\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.128906); width: 560px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608726,"PostDate":1334762346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>Our History: Boy Meets Girl\u00a0<\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>January 4, 2010<\/em><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> I love when Raoul tells the story of how we met. It involves him praying for a wife to come into his life, nearly falling in love at first sight and calling his friend all day to figure out how to spend time getting to know me. But to get him to tell this story is not easy. I on the other hand love telling stories. And so here is my version of how Raoul and I met:<\/p> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: left\"> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> In October 2009\u00a0I went on a cruise with my Mom, Grandma and Aunt Roz and a group of friends. Mamma Law had contacted Raoul whom she had known from a previous trip to host the tour. We were docked\u00a0in Nassau for two days. I was sick and didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t go the first night to the meeting and Aunt Roz stayed back with me. When Mommy and Grandma came back they kept telling me about this great guy they found for me that I have to meet. Of course I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t interest in someone from another country so I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t concerned. The next day we set out on the tour and Mommy was talking about this guy who was going to be her \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Winston.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I was distracted trying to get mommy\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s slip to stay up on me (it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t until we\u00a0got in the sun\u00a0I realized my dress was see-through.) Mommy introduced me to\u00a0Raoul and I quickly went back to focusing on my slip before I even\u00a0held eye contact. People started getting into the four vans they had for us. I would have been in Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s van but no one wanted to separate their family so\u00a0 Mommy volunteered us, and Grandma\u00a0& Aunt Roz went with Raoul and Mommy\u00a0& I jumped in another van. All day I barely noticed Raoul, mainly because I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t know what he looked like. Until reminded me later, I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t remember he came to find out inside Atlantis when we were seperated from the group. I do remember me sitting on the ground talking to him outside Atlantis about the weather in Virginia and the colors of our dirty\u00a0water as we waited for all the vans to arrive\u00a0so we can leave.<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <dl style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <dt style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"225\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/bahamas3-069.jpg?w=300&h=225\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"me_stitting_outside_atlantis\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/dt> <dd style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Me sitting on the ground talking to Raoul outside Atlantis<\/dd> <\/dl> <\/div> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> I remember asking him when we were going to eat at the Queen\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Staircase. (He had no idea then how serious I was about my food) He told us it was ok to eat the hot dogs from a street vendor which made me soooooo sick. He talked to me again\u00a0when I was feeding and playing with\u00a0a stray dog, known in The Bahamas as a \u00e2\u20ac\u0153potcake\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and he warned me not to\u00a0pet him.\u00a0I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to listen to Raoul, but I listened when my mother told me I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t go back in the country if I touched\u00a0him.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> As the tour ended, Raoul promised my mom to take her to get a Guinness beer (which isn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t the same as what we have in the states.)A few\u00a0friends jumped in Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s van and off we went to go get something to eat and\u00a0go to the beach. Raoul said he would take us to his cousin\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s restaurant at the Fish Fry. While walking there I complained he said \u00e2\u20ac\u0153it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s right here\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and it was actually a long way to walk. I was starving!<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t take long for us to feel at home there. We tried local food (like cracked conch and fried snapper) and drinks (like Sky Juice, Kalik and Guinness.) That day\u00a0I fell in love with\u00a0their amazing food.\u00a0We also had dancing lessons from the waitress. I\u00a0got a strange feeling\u00a0like\u00a0Raoul was\u00a0watching me trying to learn to\u00a0dance but I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t pay it any mind. I\u00a0was calling\u00a0Raoul my step dad all\u00a0afternoon because of the whole\u00a0\u00e2\u20ac\u009dHow Stella got her Groove back\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\u00a0thing. We had a great time at that place!<\/p> <div class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" id=\"attachment_44\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: auto;display: block\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-44\" height=\"225\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/bahamas3-107.jpg?w=300&h=225\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"GroupPhoto\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span> <p class=\"wp-caption-text\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: italic;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;color: rgb(138, 138, 138);text-align: center\"> Raoul is second from the left and I'm in the middle<\/p> <\/div> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> When we were heading\u00a0to the car to go to the beach,\u00a0I realized they threw about my Kalik beer bottle (which I wanted to save for sand). Raoul offered to get me another and walked me to another restaurant on the strip. We argued because he wanted to buy it and of course I wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t having it. I remember he made a comment about my eyes and I gave in. I waited outside talking to his buddy Rasta who was making conch salad for two ladies. I noticed the ladies were going crazy over this \u00e2\u20ac\u0153pistol\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and Rasta gave it to them and they swallowed it right up. Rasta offered me one but\u00a0I declined. (I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not in the habit of putting just anything in my mouth)\u00a0\u00a0Raoul came out from buying the beer and let Rasta drink it so I could have the bottle. While they were swallowing up \u00e2\u20ac\u0153pistols\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I asked Raoul what it was, he told me to try one, I hesitated but he told me not to worry it was safe. I figured \u00e2\u20ac\u0153When in Rome\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and sucked it down for the full Bahamas experience. It was salty and almost slimy. We headed back to everyone waiting at the car and I asked \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Raoul, what was that I just put in my mouth?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d He replied \u00e2\u20ac\u0153A reproductive organ.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d You can imagine the look on my face! I was UP-SET! I told him I thought I could trust him and I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t believe he let me put that in my mouth!\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"> <dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-42\" height=\"107\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/3.jpg?w=396&h=107\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Rasta\" width=\"396\" \/><\/span><\/dt> <dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Rasta making the Conch Salad<\/dd> <\/dl> <\/div> <\/div> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I told everyone what had just happened as soon as we reached the car and they all wanted to go investigate. So back we went so a few of them could see what I was talking about and try one. I told Raoul I would always remember him for that experience. (I attribute Rasta, Conch salad and Kalik beer to how Raoul and I got together)<\/p> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"> <dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-41\" height=\"296\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide1.jpg?w=300&h=296\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ConchPictures\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/dt> <dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> My friend Quianna looking at the pistol before trying it\u00a0but Mommy wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t eat it<\/dd> <\/dl> <\/div> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> He dropped us off at the beach and we all gave him our emails and I thought I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d never see or hear from him again. A few weeks later my mom called excited that Raoul had emailed her. I asked her to forward it to me and I noticed he sent it to everyone. I checked my junk folder and there my copy was. There was also another email. He sent me an email asking if I was married because of my hyphenated last name. He explained there had been times he let opportunities go by because he didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t speak up and he regretted that. He asked if he could email and I said it would be ok.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> After a few nice emails he asked if he could call me. I had no idea how hard he worked and how much money he spent to get me on the phone for short conversations. Once he was able to get a magic jack, and call unlimited I was hearing that enticing accent more often than I ever expected. Raoul says it was the fact he was from the Bahamas and I think it was his voice and his intelligence but he won me over and soon my mother was telling everyone I stole her man. I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t tell you when we officially started dating but I could tell you when through texts and emails we said sweet things to one another.<\/p> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"> <dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-40\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/2654edit1.png?w=200&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ScreenShot\" width=\"200\" \/><\/span><\/dt> <dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Screen Shot from My Phone<\/dd> <\/dl> <\/div> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> By the end of December I had pretty much figured out that I would fall in love with and marry this man. And the journey began.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Did you know you were going to marry your SO\u00a0before you started officially started\u00a0dating? Do you believe in love at first sight?<\/p> <div id=\"ilikeposts\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\"  style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"> <div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 12px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"710c83b38cc338b757960a3bd08bd74a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Our Journey: Long Distance Love&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 6, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Before I was branded Raoul and I dated for two years. For some this is a long time and for&amp;nbsp;others this is short. It took some time for us to get to know one another, work out the kinks and get things right but we finally did. During our first year of dating Raoul came to visit&amp;nbsp;me in Virginia three times.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-79\" height=\"296\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/raoultova.jpg?w=394&amp;amp;h=296\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"raoultova\" width=\"394\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Then&amp;nbsp;in the second year I went to visit him in The Bahamas three times.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-80\" height=\"846\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/ambertonassau.jpg?w=644&amp;amp;h=846\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ambertonassau\" width=\"644\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;There was no big reason. My family made it clear he needed to visit me first and with work schedules and finding chaperones it&amp;nbsp;who could be available, it just worked out that way.&amp;nbsp;Oh yes, chaperones. That may be an ancient word to some but Ra and I take very seriously our belief that God intended for sex to be shared between a husband and a wife only. The only way for us to ensure that is to be chaperoned so were not alone giving ourselves the opportunity to fool around. We\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve both had our share of life experiences and in that we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve come to feel that life is truly more successful when you do things God\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s way. It makes us both so happy to be able to say that we waited and have kept a clean courtship and know that our marriage can be blessed for that. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not saying that anyone else will have a doomed marriage if  they didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t wait but I feel&amp;nbsp;faith is something that should make&amp;nbsp;you feel good about what you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re doing and not make others feel bad about what they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re doing. I have to say though that&amp;nbsp;it would have been&amp;nbsp;a whole lot more difficult for us to abstain if we were not living in two different countries. A whole lot.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; If you asked Raoul would probably say I put him through hell. Good advice I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve gotten says to ensure a successful marriage find a person that fits&amp;nbsp;all your SPIES needs. That\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s spiritually, physically, intellectually, emotionally, and sexually. This is not easy to do in any relationship and is nearly impossible when you live in different countries. &amp;nbsp;I had limited time to observe him in his surroundings, to talk to his family and friends and get a sense of who he really is. Being in a LDR means we don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have tons of memories hanging out, we don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have ton\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s of pictures together and we haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t had ton\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s of dates. However, it does mean that we have had ton\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s of good conversations and are getting very good at communicating. When you have time to talk about everything you can really get to know a person. I can pretty much tell what Ra is feeling or how many beers he\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s had just by hearing his voice. My mother is sure I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll develop brain cancer from constantly having the phone to my face.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; When I tell people we are in a LDR they always ask me \u00e2\u20ac\u0153How do you do it?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Why would you want to do that!?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t really come up wait a good explanation for that. The dating process for us&amp;nbsp;is very difficult. Long distance relationships are not easy, no matter how much technology you have.&amp;nbsp;We rely heavily on the Magic Jack which allows us to talk unlimited from home&amp;nbsp;and manage to webcam a few times. In between we use the cell phone which is very expensive.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"&gt; &lt;dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-52\" height=\"225\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/007.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=225\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"webcam love\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/dt&gt; &lt;dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; One of the rare occasions he allows me to see him on the webcam&lt;\/dd&gt; &lt;\/dl&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;I believe part of what&amp;nbsp;makes us remain close is that we fall asleep on the phone together almost every night since we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve started dating. Being apart is&amp;nbsp;not something we want to do but when you fall in love with someone you do what you have to. There is a literal pain in my heart when I miss him or have to leave him at the airport. But we know it will all be over soon and this pain is temporary. I know that when we actually live together we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re going to be getting to know each other all over again and that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s actually&amp;nbsp;both exciting and scary.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t think anyone in a good marriage had a smooth journey to get there. I believe that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s just a part of life. Have you ever been in a LDR? How long did you date before you were engaged?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;All Photos Personal&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"ilikeposts\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.128906); width: 560px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608728,"PostDate":1334762507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Our Journey: Long Distance Love<\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 6, 2012<\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Before I was branded Raoul and I dated for two years. For some this is a long time and for\u00a0others this is short. It took some time for us to get to know one another, work out the kinks and get things right but we finally did. During our first year of dating Raoul came to visit\u00a0me in Virginia three times.<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-79\" height=\"296\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/raoultova.jpg?w=394&h=296\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"raoultova\" width=\"394\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Then\u00a0in the second year I went to visit him in The Bahamas three times.\u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-80\" height=\"846\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/ambertonassau.jpg?w=644&h=846\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ambertonassau\" width=\"644\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0There was no big reason. My family made it clear he needed to visit me first and with work schedules and finding chaperones it\u00a0who could be available, it just worked out that way.\u00a0Oh yes, chaperones. That may be an ancient word to some but Ra and I take very seriously our belief that God intended for sex to be shared between a husband and a wife only. The only way for us to ensure that is to be chaperoned so were not alone giving ourselves the opportunity to fool around. We\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve both had our share of life experiences and in that we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve come to feel that life is truly more successful when you do things God\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s way. It makes us both so happy to be able to say that we waited and have kept a clean courtship and know that our marriage can be blessed for that. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not saying that anyone else will have a doomed marriage if\u00a0\u00a0they didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t wait but I feel\u00a0faith is something that should make\u00a0you feel good about what you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re doing and not make others feel bad about what they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re doing. I have to say though that\u00a0it would have been\u00a0a whole lot more difficult for us to abstain if we were not living in two different countries. A whole lot.<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> If you asked Raoul would probably say I put him through hell. Good advice I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve gotten says to ensure a successful marriage find a person that fits\u00a0all your SPIES needs. That\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s spiritually, physically, intellectually, emotionally, and sexually. This is not easy to do in any relationship and is nearly impossible when you live in different countries. \u00a0I had limited time to observe him in his surroundings, to talk to his family and friends and get a sense of who he really is. Being in a LDR means we don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have tons of memories hanging out, we don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have ton\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s of pictures together and we haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t had ton\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s of dates. However, it does mean that we have had ton\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s of good conversations and are getting very good at communicating. When you have time to talk about everything you can really get to know a person. I can pretty much tell what Ra is feeling or how many beers he\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s had just by hearing his voice. My mother is sure I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll develop brain cancer from constantly having the phone to my face.<\/div> <p class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> When I tell people we are in a LDR they always ask me \u00e2\u20ac\u0153How do you do it?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Why would you want to do that!?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t really come up wait a good explanation for that. The dating process for us\u00a0is very difficult. Long distance relationships are not easy, no matter how much technology you have.\u00a0We rely heavily on the Magic Jack which allows us to talk unlimited from home\u00a0and manage to webcam a few times. In between we use the cell phone which is very expensive.<\/p> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <dl class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; display: block; max-width: 100%; \"> <dt class=\"wp-caption-dt\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-52\" height=\"225\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/007.jpg?w=300&h=225\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 98%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; display: block; margin-top: -1.2000000476837158%; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"webcam love\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/dt> <dd class=\"wp-caption-dd\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 1.615em; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 1.615em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> One of the rare occasions he allows me to see him on the webcam<\/dd> <\/dl> <\/div> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<span  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: medium;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\">I believe part of what\u00a0makes us remain close is that we fall asleep on the phone together almost every night since we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve started dating. Being apart is\u00a0not something we want to do but when you fall in love with someone you do what you have to. There is a literal pain in my heart when I miss him or have to leave him at the airport. But we know it will all be over soon and this pain is temporary. I know that when we actually live together we\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re going to be getting to know each other all over again and that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s actually\u00a0both exciting and scary.<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: medium;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\">I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t think anyone in a good marriage had a smooth journey to get there. I believe that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s just a part of life. Have you ever been in a LDR? How long did you date before you were engaged?<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: medium;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\">All Photos Personal<\/span><\/p> <div id=\"ilikeposts\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\"  style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"> <div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 12px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65f8169b56a3249dc4348a6445bee2a5","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Our Journey: Ring Shopping&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 10, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; This post could also be called: He likes it, now we have to pick a ring to put on it&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We had been talking about engagment and marriage for a very long time. There was no way I would endure the Long Distance Relationship if I did not forsee marriage in our future. He&amp;nbsp;had proposed over the phone long before we found out when I had off work and booked my ticket. Many girls&amp;nbsp;from a LDR can understand that the intention stated is&amp;nbsp;all that is needed to make it real.  I had known in my heart we were getting married from some time and had been \u00e2\u20ac\u0153not so secretly\u00e2\u20ac\u009d working on wedding plans.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Everyone hopes to have an amazing proposal story. I had read through hundreds of stories and dreamed about different ways Raoul could propose. I had even emailed him a few I really liked. When we talked about it I tried to take the pressure off, telling him I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need all that jazz. I honestly didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want him to spend way too much money on a ring or proposal, but I wanted a sweet story to share with my future children. So my son would know how to treat a woman, my daughter would know how she should be treated, and they would know the love their father had for their mother.  &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I also wanted a special story&amp;nbsp;for those who would feel he&amp;nbsp;may not be \u00e2\u20ac\u0153good enough\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&amp;nbsp;since I was not getting $3,000 ring. I wanted to prove that showing love is more important than buying love. Just as important as the proposal is \u00e2\u20ac\u0153the ring.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Raoul talked to a few of his&amp;nbsp;friends and decided that the money would be better spent on starting off the marriage comfortably and not a piece of jewelry that could always be upgraded. I agreed but mostly because I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m \u00e2\u20ac\u0153cheap\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and I know I lose everything so wearing anything on my hand that cost more than $50 scared the kitty litter out of me. Selecting the engagment ring was a big battle. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to apologize now for the long post, it was a crazy long process. Raoul had purchased a wedding set minus the center stone. I accidentally saw it on his phone one day and I let it slip that I hated it and didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t trust his taste. He wanted to see a picture of what I had in mind. &amp;nbsp;This was my first request.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-68\" height=\"231\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/cushion-halo-harry-winston-diamond-engagement-ring.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=231\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"cushion-halo-harry-winston-diamond-engagement-ring\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-71\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/ring.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ring\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-67\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/il_570xn_3058491111.jpg?w=298&amp;amp;h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"il_570xN_305849111\" width=\"298\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-69\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/2508793860544040_1.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"2508793860544040_1\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-72\" height=\"207\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/stackable1.jpg?w=300&amp;amp;h=207\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"stackable1\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/boards.weddingbee.com\/topic\/stacked-ring-sets\"&gt;Source&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I love it because I could change it up. I could incorporate color and not worry about getting tired of it or it clashing. I also didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have to worry about the gap between the e-ring and the band. By the time Raoul saw the pictures he was so over rings he said I \u00e2\u20ac\u0153had sucked all of the joy out of it\u00e2\u20ac\u009d. Trying to salvage what was left of his feelings and make sure I was still getting a&amp;nbsp;proposal&amp;nbsp;I tried to work on a compromise. We&amp;nbsp;decided to switch things around. So he would purchase a wedding band to propose with and get my dream etsy ring later (since it took a few months to be made and he had to save up) He told me to find a ring online and I searched and searched. I preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/\"&gt;etsy&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;because it was unique and handmade, which meant it took longer. Raoul preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.overstock.com\/\"&gt;overstock.com&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;which I found to have either cheap or expensive and not much in between. I also search&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.jtv.com\/\"&gt;jewelry tv\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s website&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and really liked their selections. But when they failed I turned to Google images. &amp;nbsp;The only ring I liked was more than I wanted to spend on the whole wedding and nothing compared to it.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I just told him to pick whatever and I would be happy. Raoul went ring shopping for a few days and came back fustrated he couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find anything I would like. The women at the store told him if I was being this picky maybe he should reconsider marrying me. He&amp;nbsp;finally gave in (meaning he procrastinated)&amp;nbsp;and said when I get&amp;nbsp;there&amp;nbsp;we will go ring shopping together.&amp;nbsp;We were both burned out but all we could do was wait until I booked a ticket to go visit him.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I learned not to stress out your man too much and that I can be a bit of a diva when I want to get my way. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t exactly get my \u00e2\u20ac\u0153dream ring\u00e2\u20ac\u009d but I got something so much better, stay tuned to see. Did you have any input in selecting your ring?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"ilikeposts\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.128906); width: 560px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608731,"PostDate":1334762601,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Our Journey: Ring Shopping<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 10, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> This post could also be called: He likes it, now we have to pick a ring to put on it<\/p> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> We had been talking about engagment and marriage for a very long time. There was no way I would endure the Long Distance Relationship if I did not forsee marriage in our future. He\u00a0had proposed over the phone long before we found out when I had off work and booked my ticket. Many girls\u00a0from a LDR can understand that the intention stated is\u00a0all that is needed to make it real.\u00a0\u00a0I had known in my heart we were getting married from some time and had been \u00e2\u20ac\u0153not so secretly\u00e2\u20ac\u009d working on wedding plans.<\/div> <\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> Everyone hopes to have an amazing proposal story. I had read through hundreds of stories and dreamed about different ways Raoul could propose. I had even emailed him a few I really liked. When we talked about it I tried to take the pressure off, telling him I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need all that jazz. I honestly didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want him to spend way too much money on a ring or proposal, but I wanted a sweet story to share with my future children. So my son would know how to treat a woman, my daughter would know how she should be treated, and they would know the love their father had for their mother.\u00a0\u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I also wanted a special story\u00a0for those who would feel he\u00a0may not be \u00e2\u20ac\u0153good enough\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\u00a0since I was not getting $3,000 ring. I wanted to prove that showing love is more important than buying love. Just as important as the proposal is \u00e2\u20ac\u0153the ring.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Raoul talked to a few of his\u00a0friends and decided that the money would be better spent on starting off the marriage comfortably and not a piece of jewelry that could always be upgraded. I agreed but mostly because I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m \u00e2\u20ac\u0153cheap\u00e2\u20ac\u009d and I know I lose everything so wearing anything on my hand that cost more than $50 scared the kitty litter out of me. Selecting the engagment ring was a big battle. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to apologize now for the long post, it was a crazy long process. Raoul had purchased a wedding set minus the center stone. I accidentally saw it on his phone one day and I let it slip that I hated it and didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t trust his taste. He wanted to see a picture of what I had in mind. \u00a0This was my first request.<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-68\" height=\"231\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/cushion-halo-harry-winston-diamond-engagement-ring.jpg?w=300&h=231\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"cushion-halo-harry-winston-diamond-engagement-ring\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-71\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/ring.jpg?w=300&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"ring\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-67\" height=\"300\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/il_570xn_3058491111.jpg?w=298&h=300\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"il_570xN_305849111\" width=\"298\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-69\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/2508793860544040_1.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"2508793860544040_1\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-72\" height=\"207\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/stackable1.jpg?w=300&h=207\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"stackable1\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <a href='http:\/\/boards.weddingbee.com\/topic\/stacked-ring-sets' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Source<\/a><\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I love it because I could change it up. I could incorporate color and not worry about getting tired of it or it clashing. I also didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have to worry about the gap between the e-ring and the band. By the time Raoul saw the pictures he was so over rings he said I \u00e2\u20ac\u0153had sucked all of the joy out of it\u00e2\u20ac\u009d. Trying to salvage what was left of his feelings and make sure I was still getting a\u00a0proposal\u00a0I tried to work on a compromise. We\u00a0decided to switch things around. So he would purchase a wedding band to propose with and get my dream etsy ring later (since it took a few months to be made and he had to save up) He told me to find a ring online and I searched and searched. I preferred\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>etsy<\/a>\u00a0because it was unique and handmade, which meant it took longer. Raoul preferred\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.overstock.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>overstock.com<\/a>\u00a0which I found to have either cheap or expensive and not much in between. I also search\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.jtv.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>jewelry tv\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s website<\/a>\u00a0and really liked their selections. But when they failed I turned to Google images. \u00a0The only ring I liked was more than I wanted to spend on the whole wedding and nothing compared to it.<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I just told him to pick whatever and I would be happy. Raoul went ring shopping for a few days and came back fustrated he couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find anything I would like. The women at the store told him if I was being this picky maybe he should reconsider marrying me. He\u00a0finally gave in (meaning he procrastinated)\u00a0and said when I get\u00a0there\u00a0we will go ring shopping together.\u00a0We were both burned out but all we could do was wait until I booked a ticket to go visit him.<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"mceTemp mceIEcenter\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I learned not to stress out your man too much and that I can be a bit of a diva when I want to get my way. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t exactly get my \u00e2\u20ac\u0153dream ring\u00e2\u20ac\u009d but I got something so much better, stay tuned to see. Did you have any input in selecting your ring?<\/div> <\/div> <div id=\"ilikeposts\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\"  style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"> <div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 12px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"112c1b33d5441ef4a97bea67edf5f334","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Our Journey: The Proposal&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 12, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; Raoul officially proposed during my visit to The Bahamas in December 2011. He&amp;nbsp;had proposed over the phone&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-85\" height=\"316\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/06-09-2005_12_35_56pm.jpg?w=614&amp;amp;h=316\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"06-09-2005_12_35_56PM\" width=\"614\" \/&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-83\" height=\"187\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/henry-stack-rings-set.png?w=300&amp;amp;h=187\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"henry-stack-rings-set\" width=\"300\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-89\" height=\"461\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dscf3597.jpg?w=614&amp;amp;h=461\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSCF3597\" width=\"614\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This is Jaws Beach but from April when I visited (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; We sat down to rest for a bit and Raoul began to tell me how he felt overwhelmed&amp;nbsp;and thanked me for my patience with him. He explained he had intended to propose at the restaurant the night before when we went out with the couples, he thought out on the water in front of everyone would be perfect. I disagreed but kept quiet (for once). He then&amp;nbsp;said \u00e2\u20ac\u0153I know I should do this on one knee but on two feet and two butt cheeks, Amber Dominique Roberts-Butler, will you be my wife?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I was speechless for the first time in my life and could only move my lips to form yes.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dd.jpg?w=360&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"myring\" width=\"360\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I got my ring! YAY! (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; The moment was overwhelming. Even though I expected it every moment, I was&amp;nbsp;still caught off guard that it was actually happening. We were making history! I had only one little tear well up in my eye. I was more than happy, more than content and more than in love. We sat for a few moments longer, talking and hugging. I told him I was so glad he did it in my favorite place (the beach) and with just us for such a personal moment. I also told him I was&amp;nbsp;pissed he messed up my pictures because he waited until I used up all my cute outfits and when my hair was no longer freshly done! I wasthinking of all the beautiful photographs I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen on wedding blogs. We might have sealed it with a kissed.&amp;nbsp;After we left went to see&amp;nbsp;Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s mom and show her the ring on my finger. We then went back to his house and Raoul took a nap while I used the&amp;nbsp;internet phone&amp;nbsp;to call my family to share the good news. Everyone asked did I feel different and I really didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t because in my head we were \u00e2\u20ac\u0153engaged\u00e2\u20ac\u009d for a while. Once that pretty little ring went on my finger I&amp;nbsp;did feel&amp;nbsp;better than I had before \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I felt it was more real. I felt he had finally peed on me and marked his territory!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-87\" height=\"614\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/proposalpictures.jpg?w=717&amp;amp;h=614\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"proposalpictures\" width=\"717\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Personal Photos&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I felt my proposal was perfect even though it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t what I expected. Were you surprised when you got engaged? Do you think it means a woman is high maintenance if she want\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s to have a part in selecting her ring?&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608732,"PostDate":1334762752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Our Journey: The Proposal<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 12, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> Raoul officially proposed during my visit to The Bahamas in December 2011. He\u00a0had proposed over the phone\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-85\" height=\"316\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/06-09-2005_12_35_56pm.jpg?w=614&h=316\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"06-09-2005_12_35_56PM\" width=\"614\" \/><\/span> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-83\" height=\"187\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/henry-stack-rings-set.png?w=300&h=187\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"henry-stack-rings-set\" width=\"300\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-89\" height=\"461\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dscf3597.jpg?w=614&h=461\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSCF3597\" width=\"614\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This is Jaws Beach but from April when I visited (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> We sat down to rest for a bit and Raoul began to tell me how he felt overwhelmed\u00a0and thanked me for my patience with him. He explained he had intended to propose at the restaurant the night before when we went out with the couples, he thought out on the water in front of everyone would be perfect. I disagreed but kept quiet (for once). He then\u00a0said \u00e2\u20ac\u0153I know I should do this on one knee but on two feet and two butt cheeks, Amber Dominique Roberts-Butler, will you be my wife?\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I was speechless for the first time in my life and could only move my lips to form yes.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dd.jpg?w=360&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"myring\" width=\"360\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I got my ring! YAY! (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> The moment was overwhelming. Even though I expected it every moment, I was\u00a0still caught off guard that it was actually happening. We were making history! I had only one little tear well up in my eye. I was more than happy, more than content and more than in love. We sat for a few moments longer, talking and hugging. I told him I was so glad he did it in my favorite place (the beach) and with just us for such a personal moment. I also told him I was\u00a0pissed he messed up my pictures because he waited until I used up all my cute outfits and when my hair was no longer freshly done! I wasthinking of all the beautiful photographs I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve seen on wedding blogs. We might have sealed it with a kissed.\u00a0After we left went to see\u00a0Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s mom and show her the ring on my finger. We then went back to his house and Raoul took a nap while I used the\u00a0internet phone\u00a0to call my family to share the good news. Everyone asked did I feel different and I really didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t because in my head we were \u00e2\u20ac\u0153engaged\u00e2\u20ac\u009d for a while. Once that pretty little ring went on my finger I\u00a0did feel\u00a0better than I had before \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I felt it was more real. I felt he had finally peed on me and marked his territory!<\/p> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-87\" height=\"614\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/proposalpictures.jpg?w=717&h=614\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"proposalpictures\" width=\"717\" \/><\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Personal Photos<\/div> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I felt my proposal was perfect even though it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t what I expected. Were you surprised when you got engaged? Do you think it means a woman is high maintenance if she want\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s to have a part in selecting her ring?<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73a99245e4d5dec2a3cac35ffa23db9d","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Git er Done&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 14, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; G&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-105\" height=\"139\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/7955-git-er-done-m0202020203.jpg?w=303&amp;amp;h=139\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"7955-GIT-ER-DONE-M0202020203\" width=\"303\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-257\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/weddingdate.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"weddingdate\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Personal Image&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; So the first accomplishment on our wedding planning was checked off the list, we had a date. Which meant I could really take off on planning and \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Git er Done!\u00e2\u20ac\u009d How long did it take you to finalize a date? Did you have to consider&amp;nbsp;the schedules or family and friends?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"ilikeposts\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.128906); width: 560px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608733,"PostDate":1334762871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Git er Done<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 14, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> G<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-105\" height=\"139\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/7955-git-er-done-m0202020203.jpg?w=303&h=139\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"7955-GIT-ER-DONE-M0202020203\" width=\"303\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-257\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/weddingdate.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"weddingdate\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> Personal Image<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> So the first accomplishment on our wedding planning was checked off the list, we had a date. Which meant I could really take off on planning and \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Git er Done!\u00e2\u20ac\u009d How long did it take you to finalize a date? Did you have to consider\u00a0the schedules or family and friends?\u00a0<\/p> <div id=\"ilikeposts\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div class=\"sharedaddy sd-like-enabled sd-sharing-enabled\"  style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; clear: both; border-top-left-radius: 0px !important; border-top-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px !important; zoom: 1; \"> <div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 12px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9d4c1e0113f6eca63947365ff5d5878","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;My Big Fat Green Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 16, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; I love green! I love chartreuse, kelly green, mint, and olive. I love seeing spinach and broccoli on my plate. I love pearly green punch buggies. I love my green contacts. I also love green weddings. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve wanted one every since I found out they exist. So I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve been having images of green wedding in my head as I dream about the possibilities.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-169\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/125397170844530060_uzkc7z5n_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844530060_UzKc7z5N_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-173\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/125397170844530077_8detgnxa_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844530077_8deTGNXA_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/breezinentertainment.typepad.com\/breezin_entertainment_blo\/2009\/08\/eco-chic-weddings-green-tablescape-inspiration.html\"&gt;Source&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Can you tell the difference? I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want the color green, I wanted eco-friendly green. I know little \u00e2\u20ac\u02dcole me cannot make all the difference in the world, but I try in as many ways as I can to help keep the earth thriving. I figure if one person gets inspired and tries then I made a difference, and maybe they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll inspire someone and so on. So a green wedding is&amp;nbsp;a great way for me to make a small difference and&amp;nbsp;since being green is contagious I can hopefully infect (er, inspire) a&amp;nbsp;large group of&amp;nbsp;people. Another advantage of being green is I&amp;nbsp;can incorporate my love of nature.&amp;nbsp;There are two places&amp;nbsp;I&amp;nbsp;love the most, the beach and the woods and having a celebration there would make me nothing but happy. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited about using wood and other&amp;nbsp;elements from nature.&amp;nbsp;I did plenty, plenty research on green weddings so I could learn all the ways I could possibly be green and choose what could fit us. On Weddingbee, Mrs.Cherry Pie&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingbee.com\/2008\/04\/22\/green-wedding-ideas-and-inspiration\/\"&gt;gave me a great start&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Mrs. Pino Noir helped me appreciate my (half)&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingbee.com\/2008\/07\/23\/making-a-destination-wedding-green\/\"&gt;destination wedding could still be green&lt;\/a&gt;. So here\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s how I plan to be green:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; LOCATION&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; For the Bahamas wedding we plan to have the ceremony and reception at one place. Either at a restaurant, private beach or the national park.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We plan to have the Virginia (AHR) Reception at a park.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; WEDDING ATTIRE&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Instead of buying a new dress I plan to revamp my mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s first wedding dress and one of her prom dresses to create my own memorable dress.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; The requirements for the other members of the family\/bridal party attire are that it must be either reused or purchased new with the intent of re-wearing. Hopefully no one will spend more than $150 on their attire.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; PAPER PRODUCTS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We plan to buy recycled paper as much as possible. Response options can be either postcards (with no envelope) or responding online.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We hope to create a detailed website to avoid having to use extra paper to give guests details not everyone will need.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; FOOD AND TABLEWARE&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Buying used with the hope of reusing or reselling will be my first choice if renting is not the cheaper option.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; We plan to not have styrofoam, plastic or paper products if at all possible to reduce what\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s thrown in the trash. For the Bahamas reception we will purchase bamboo\/leaf plates, wood utensils and use cloth napkins. For the Virginia reception I will try to collect patterned china from family members, thrift stores and craigslist. I hope to use real glasses or cups of recycled materials for both events.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I would love to find different patterned cloth napkins to later&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.purlbee.com\/the-purl-bee\/2008\/12\/28\/colorful-crafting-with-jen-wedding-wheel-quilt.html\"&gt;turn into a quilt&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I hope to collect wine bottles, glass jars and tin cans to use for decor and food storage.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; As much as possible the menus will consist of local foods.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; FLOWERS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Flowers will be used as little as possible and if used will be local grown or potted plants.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; D\u00a9cor, bouquets and boutonnieres will consist of sola wood flowers, seashells, feathers and fabric.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; No birdseed or alternatives will be thrown&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; GIFTS AND FAVORS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Since it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a destination wedding and were looking for guests presence and not presents we plan to not register for tons of things I mostly have since I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m established in my home.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Gifts for wedding party members will be gifts they will get use out of.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Favors will be edible or reusable so guests will get the most benefit out of them&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Because it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a half destination wedding, guests flying will contribute to global warming via the carbon dioxide. It would be great to give each guest an 11-watt compact fluorescent bulb to replace a 50-watt incandescent bulb with their wedding favor will save 685 pounds of carbon dioxide. (Tip found in:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;Sierra Club Magazine&lt;\/em&gt;\u00e2\u20ac\u02dcs interview with an environmental studies and biology professor from Oberlin, Ohio)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; PROGRAMS AND MENUS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left; \"&gt; Individual menus will not be necessary. We will display options for guest on one sign, maybe a chalkboard.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left; \"&gt; Programs will be made with recyclable material and hopefully be a keepsake to save them trash.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Towards the end of planning I hope to have accomplished all these goals! Are you planning to be green in your wedding planning or daily life?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608779,"PostDate":1334769060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">My Big Fat Green Wedding<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 16, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> I love green! I love chartreuse, kelly green, mint, and olive. I love seeing spinach and broccoli on my plate. I love pearly green punch buggies. I love my green contacts. I also love green weddings. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve wanted one every since I found out they exist. So I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve been having images of green wedding in my head as I dream about the possibilities.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-169\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/125397170844530060_uzkc7z5n_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844530060_UzKc7z5N_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-173\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/125397170844530077_8detgnxa_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844530077_8deTGNXA_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <a href='http:\/\/breezinentertainment.typepad.com\/breezin_entertainment_blo\/2009\/08\/eco-chic-weddings-green-tablescape-inspiration.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Source<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Can you tell the difference? I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want the color green, I wanted eco-friendly green. I know little \u00e2\u20ac\u02dcole me cannot make all the difference in the world, but I try in as many ways as I can to help keep the earth thriving. I figure if one person gets inspired and tries then I made a difference, and maybe they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll inspire someone and so on. So a green wedding is\u00a0a great way for me to make a small difference and\u00a0since being green is contagious I can hopefully infect (er, inspire) a\u00a0large group of\u00a0people. Another advantage of being green is I\u00a0can incorporate my love of nature.\u00a0There are two places\u00a0I\u00a0love the most, the beach and the woods and having a celebration there would make me nothing but happy. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so excited about using wood and other\u00a0elements from nature.\u00a0I did plenty, plenty research on green weddings so I could learn all the ways I could possibly be green and choose what could fit us. On Weddingbee, Mrs.Cherry Pie\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingbee.com\/2008\/04\/22\/green-wedding-ideas-and-inspiration\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>gave me a great start<\/a>\u00a0and Mrs. Pino Noir helped me appreciate my (half)\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingbee.com\/2008\/07\/23\/making-a-destination-wedding-green\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>destination wedding could still be green<\/a>. So here\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s how I plan to be green:<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> LOCATION<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> For the Bahamas wedding we plan to have the ceremony and reception at one place. Either at a restaurant, private beach or the national park.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> We plan to have the Virginia (AHR) Reception at a park.<\/li> <\/ol> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> WEDDING ATTIRE<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Instead of buying a new dress I plan to revamp my mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s first wedding dress and one of her prom dresses to create my own memorable dress.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> The requirements for the other members of the family\/bridal party attire are that it must be either reused or purchased new with the intent of re-wearing. Hopefully no one will spend more than $150 on their attire.<\/li> <\/ol> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> PAPER PRODUCTS<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> We plan to buy recycled paper as much as possible. Response options can be either postcards (with no envelope) or responding online.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> We hope to create a detailed website to avoid having to use extra paper to give guests details not everyone will need.<\/li> <\/ol> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> FOOD AND TABLEWARE<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Buying used with the hope of reusing or reselling will be my first choice if renting is not the cheaper option.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> We plan to not have styrofoam, plastic or paper products if at all possible to reduce what\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s thrown in the trash. For the Bahamas reception we will purchase bamboo\/leaf plates, wood utensils and use cloth napkins. For the Virginia reception I will try to collect patterned china from family members, thrift stores and craigslist. I hope to use real glasses or cups of recycled materials for both events.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> I would love to find different patterned cloth napkins to later\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.purlbee.com\/the-purl-bee\/2008\/12\/28\/colorful-crafting-with-jen-wedding-wheel-quilt.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>turn into a quilt<\/a>.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> I hope to collect wine bottles, glass jars and tin cans to use for decor and food storage.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> As much as possible the menus will consist of local foods.<\/li> <\/ol> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> FLOWERS<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Flowers will be used as little as possible and if used will be local grown or potted plants.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> D\u00a9cor, bouquets and boutonnieres will consist of sola wood flowers, seashells, feathers and fabric.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> No birdseed or alternatives will be thrown<\/li> <\/ol> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> GIFTS AND FAVORS<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Since it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a destination wedding and were looking for guests presence and not presents we plan to not register for tons of things I mostly have since I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m established in my home.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Gifts for wedding party members will be gifts they will get use out of.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Favors will be edible or reusable so guests will get the most benefit out of them<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> Because it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a half destination wedding, guests flying will contribute to global warming via the carbon dioxide. It would be great to give each guest an 11-watt compact fluorescent bulb to replace a 50-watt incandescent bulb with their wedding favor will save 685 pounds of carbon dioxide. (Tip found in:\u00a0<em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \">Sierra Club Magazine<\/em>\u00e2\u20ac\u02dcs interview with an environmental studies and biology professor from Oberlin, Ohio)<\/li> <\/ol> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> PROGRAMS AND MENUS<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; text-align: center; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left; \"> Individual menus will not be necessary. We will display options for guest on one sign, maybe a chalkboard.<\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left; \"> Programs will be made with recyclable material and hopefully be a keepsake to save them trash.<\/li> <\/ol> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Towards the end of planning I hope to have accomplished all these goals! Are you planning to be green in your wedding planning or daily life?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"528475ae0bde11bf69fbf11bd0664f73","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"entry-content\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 1.615em; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Pretty Ways to Say \"Oh, You Better Be There!\" &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 20, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; When I envision my wedding day I&amp;nbsp;see all the people I love and care about smiling at me, hugging me and having a good time at a beautiful party.&amp;nbsp; I honestly feel bad that having the wedding in The Bahamas means I won\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have everyone there. I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want anyone missing from the group but I know with a destination wedding, in this economy, that\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s not possible.&amp;nbsp; The upside is I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have to worry about having a super large wedding, which I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll explain later. But to make sure as many as possible can be in attendance, I wanted to send out a&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-285\" height=\"368\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide2.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=368\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-c