ackground-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide4\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-288\" height=\"505\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide5.jpg?w=640&h=505\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide5\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-298\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide9.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide9\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-289\" height=\"335\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide6.jpg?w=640&h=335\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide6\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-291\" height=\"497\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide8.jpg?w=640&h=497\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide8\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span>\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/masonjarbride.blogspot.com\/2009\/02\/as-promised.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Image via masonjarbride<\/a><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s so pretty right. The best part is it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s green and cheap. It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s made with repurposed cardboard boxes, labels, lace trim and ribbon. I knew this would work well in my shrinking budget and I loved the contrast of the torn cardboard and pretty lace. \u00a0I liked all these STD\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s because they were different than just a picture of the couple\u00a0of someone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s fridge. Not that there\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s anything wrong with them, I just feel weird about my face on your fridge until you get sick of it. Plus I have a strong desire to be creative, unique and different than the rest. Being the indecisive person I am I had such\u00a0a very hard time choosing one.\u00a0So it was time to start designing. YAY! Which do you like best?\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af9814f97c44a0edef2019745041e29f","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;The Colors Duke, The Colors!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 23, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m a child of the 90\u00e2\u20ac\u00b2s so I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t talk about colors without hearing this comercial in my head.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; display: block; \"&gt;&lt;iframe class=\"youtube-player\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/VwlMHJE82Mk?version=3&amp;amp;rel=1&amp;amp;fs=1&amp;amp;showsearch=0&amp;amp;showinfo=1&amp;amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;amp;wmode=transparent\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; \" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\"&gt;&lt;\/iframe&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Being a designer colors are one of my favorite parts of creating a mood. It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s not all what looks pretty, there is a large amount of psychology involved. Did you know that more people argue in a yellow room than any other color? Did you know blue is an appetite suppressant, making it a great color for dinner plates when you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re on a diet, but stimulates you to drink making it a great color for a bar? Did you know most fast food places use red and yellow because the two colors stimulate your appetite and the high energy makes you impulsive and order more? Did you know that they painted walls every color in prison and the only color that kept the men calm was pink? I could go on for days. That\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s why I love color, it has such a powerful affect on people and they don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t even realize.  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t take the correct designer approach when I started choosing colors for my wedding. I had fallen in love with a bright shade called coral. I thought it was tropical, fun and gave me a enough of my favorite color pink without actually being pink. I was also crazy about the color of the water in the Bahamas. It was an aqua that made me feel all kinds of good things inside. &amp;nbsp;I thought how cute, a shade of pink for my favorite color and a shade of blue for Ra\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s. I also loved that together the two colors were high energy and creating a fun, energetic, party atmosphere.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-253\" height=\"350\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/coralaquaberry.jpg?w=459&amp;amp;h=350\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"coralaquaberry\" width=\"459\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-273\" height=\"456\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/coralattire1.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=456\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"coralattire\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-274\" height=\"307\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/etsyfinds.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=307\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; 