u20ac\u2122t she lovely?\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-265\" height=\"431\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/marthapeachesncream.jpg?w=687&amp;amp;h=431\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"marthapeachesncream\" width=\"687\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; What a beautiful combination of peach and pink!&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-268\" height=\"442\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/blushwedding.jpg?w=699&amp;amp;h=442\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"blushwedding\" width=\"699\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-270\" height=\"450\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/sparklywedding.jpg?w=796&amp;amp;h=450\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"sparklywedding\" width=\"796\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/greenweddingshoes.com\/a-new-years-eve-sparkly-wedding\/\"&gt;Source&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;When I looked back and the journey I traveled selecting my color scheme I realized my mother did the same thing. Only she changed her mind between two schemes everyday for almost a month and she drove me crazy. Hey it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a very important decision to make!&amp;nbsp; Have you ever called a woman a bridezilla&amp;nbsp;and later realized you did the same thing? Did you change your color scheme a few times?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608781,"PostDate":1334769306,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">The Colors Duke, The Colors!<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 23, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m a child of the 90\u00e2\u20ac\u00b2s so I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t talk about colors without hearing this comercial in my head.<\/p> <p> <span class=\"embed-youtube\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center;display: block\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/VwlMHJE82Mk?version=3&rel=1&fs=1&showsearch=0&showinfo=1&iv_load_policy=1&wmode=transparent\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; max-width: 100%; \" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\"><\/iframe><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> Being a designer colors are one of my favorite parts of creating a mood. It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s not all what looks pretty, there is a large amount of psychology involved. Did you know that more people argue in a yellow room than any other color? Did you know blue is an appetite suppressant, making it a great color for dinner plates when you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re on a diet, but stimulates you to drink making it a great color for a bar? Did you know most fast food places use red and yellow because the two colors stimulate your appetite and the high energy makes you impulsive and order more? Did you know that they painted walls every color in prison and the only color that kept the men calm was pink? I could go on for days. That\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s why I love color, it has such a powerful affect on people and they don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t even realize.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t take the correct designer approach when I started choosing colors for my wedding. I had fallen in love with a bright shade called coral. I thought it was tropical, fun and gave me a enough of my favorite color pink without actually being pink. I was also crazy about the color of the water in the Bahamas. It was an aqua that made me feel all kinds of good things inside. \u00a0I thought how cute, a shade of pink for my favorite color and a shade of blue for Ra\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s. I also loved that together the two colors were high energy and creating a fun, energetic, party atmosphere.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-253\" height=\"350\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/coralaquaberry.jpg?w=459&h=350\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"coralaquaberry\" width=\"459\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-273\" height=\"456\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/coralattire1.jpg?w=640&h=456\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"coralattire\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-274\" height=\"307\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/etsyfinds.jpg?w=640&h=307\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"etsyfinds\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-195\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844531173_218xiq36_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0