gncenter wp-image-254\" height=\"357\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/coral_and_sand_copy.jpg?w=447&h=357\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Coral_and_Sand_copy\" width=\"447\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-277\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/seafoam_pink-550x600.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"seafoam_pink-550x600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-187\" height=\"558\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/46443439876760293_csmsq3dk_c.jpg?w=444&h=558\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"46443439876760293_csMsQ3dK_c\" width=\"444\" \/><\/span>Isn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t she lovely?\/\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-265\" height=\"431\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/marthapeachesncream.jpg?w=687&h=431\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"marthapeachesncream\" width=\"687\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> What a beautiful combination of peach and pink!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-268\" height=\"442\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/blushwedding.jpg?w=699&h=442\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"blushwedding\" width=\"699\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-270\" height=\"450\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/sparklywedding.jpg?w=796&h=450\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"sparklywedding\" width=\"796\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <a href='http:\/\/greenweddingshoes.com\/a-new-years-eve-sparkly-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Source<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0When I looked back and the journey I traveled selecting my color scheme I realized my mother did the same thing. Only she changed her mind between two schemes everyday for almost a month and she drove me crazy. Hey it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a very important decision to make!\u00a0 Have you ever called a woman a bridezilla\u00a0and later realized you did the same thing? Did you change your color scheme a few times?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ad3492f1dfdf6d554f03199f2c2210d","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Wedding Planned, Insert Groom Here&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 24, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;Remember I told you I had started not so secretly planning the wedding before we were officially engaged? The slightly type-A and slightly OCD crazed person in me&amp;nbsp;wanted to get a head start so I can avoid stress and anxiety later. Plus I wanted to take advantage of good deals. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t intend to just \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Insert groom here.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I did a lot of research on The Bahamas and Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s likes and dislikes to make it an event both of us would be happy with. I had asked Raoul tons of questions and he had input on our future wedding but he had no idea I had been collecting a secret Monica closet full of stuff for the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-112\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/monicacloset.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"monicacloset\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-111\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/mcx-bridezilla-mdn.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"mcx-bridezilla-mdn\" \/&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.marieclaire.com\/sex-love\/relationship-issues\/single-bridezillas-trend\"&gt;Source&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; They discussed Marie Claire article about woman planning the wedding before they have the groom, which you can&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.marieclaire.com\/sex-love\/relationship-issues\/single-bridezillas-trend\"&gt;read here&lt;\/a&gt;. It was comforting to learn I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not the only one. Not that I want to be in the club with Kim Kardashian, sorry Kim. But not every woman does it to have a fairy tale, some are thinking of saving time and money. I believe my hard worked paid off. I have some amazing finds at a great price&amp;nbsp;which I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t wait to share with you and I was able to work out some kinks. Brides have a tendency to change their minds tons of time and drive those around them crazy. I was able to do a lot of research (which really means&amp;nbsp;unproductively spends months and months saving pictures off wedding blogs and Google images) I found lots of great ideas I can DIY, finally figured out my color scheme, narrowed down venus and menus, became addicted to favors,&amp;nbsp;bookmarked&amp;nbsp;plently of sites trying to find the lowest prices&amp;nbsp;and more. Winning!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Did you secretly pre-plan? It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s ok you can tell the truth, I won\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t judge you.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608782,"PostDate":1334769457,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Wedding Planned, Insert Groom Here<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 24, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0Remember I told you I had started not so secretly planning the wedding before we were officially engaged? The slightly type-A and slightly OCD crazed person in me\u00a0wanted to get a head start so I can avoid stress and anxiety later. Plus I wanted to take advantage of good deals. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t intend to just \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Insert groom here.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I did a lot of research on The Bahamas and Raoul\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s likes and dislikes to make it an event both of us would be happy with. I had asked Raoul tons of questions and he had input on our future wedding but he had no idea I had been collecting a secret Monica closet full of stuff for the wedding.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-112\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/monicacloset.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"monicacloset\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-111\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/mcx-bridezilla-mdn.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"mcx-bridezilla-mdn\" \/><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.marieclaire.com\/sex-love\/relationship-issues\/single-bridezillas-trend' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Source<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> They discussed Marie Claire article about woman planning the wedding before they have the groom, which you can\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.marieclaire.com\/sex-love\/relationship-issues\/single-bridezillas-trend' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>read here<\/a>. It was comforting to learn I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m not the only one. Not that I want to be in the club with Kim Kardashian, sorry Kim. But not every woman does it to have a fairy tale, some are thinking of saving time and money. I believe my hard worked paid off. I have some amazing finds at a great price\u00a0which I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t wait to share with you and I was able to work out some kinks. Brides have a tendency to change their minds tons of time and drive those around them crazy. I was able to do a lot of research (which really means\u00a0unproductively spends months and months saving pictures off wedding blogs and Google images) I found lots of great ideas I can DIY, finally figured out my color scheme, narrowed down venus and menus, became addicted to favors,\u00a0bookmarked\u00a0plently of sites trying to find the lowest prices\u00a0and more. Winning!<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Did you secretly pre-plan? It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s ok you can tell the truth, I won\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t judge you.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"66973","Title":"DominiqueAmber's Wedding Planning Blog","LastPostDate":1379170924},"Pages":{"TotalItems":87,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
