{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94040d53ee12a9b06aa029d996f228c7","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Save the Date Journey: Designing, Ordering and Assembling&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 26, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; When I showed Raoul and his mother during my visit they were quite impressed. Raoul made me feel warm and fuzzy when he told me I continued to amaze him. I returned home determined to get them finished and sent out so everyone had plenty time to save up and get off work. I perfected the&amp;nbsp;passport pages&amp;nbsp;while waiting on a date so I could start printing. I decided to add some pictures since&amp;nbsp;a lot of my family and friends hadn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t seen Ra and I knew it would make the older guests happy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-333\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/lpbackedit.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"lpbackedit\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; (Personal Image)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I left a space at the top to&amp;nbsp;add a magnet to it that way you could put it on your fridge but my face is hidden!  Sorry, I had to remove our website. I needed to get an idea of who was really interested in coming for planning purposes and I remembered I had seen an early bird rsvp a girl had made while ago.&amp;nbsp; I wanted the package to be fun and interactive and&amp;nbsp;I remembered&amp;nbsp;this image I had saved on my computer. Of course I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find it and after persistent googling I found it again.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter\" height=\"435\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/4378714527_66ebf6eec5_z1.jpg?w=580&amp;amp;h=435\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" width=\"580\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/rsvpf.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpf\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-334\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/rsvpbedit.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpbedit\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;(Personal Images)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I loved it and I had hopes and dreams that I could collect sweet, meaningful messages and display them one day. I changed the address so you can see the pretty font, although it looks so much better with my address! By the way this was&amp;nbsp;like draft 12&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;I was so tired of looking at it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; When we&amp;nbsp;finally got a date and I was able to&amp;nbsp;place my Vistaprint order. Oh, after three days of trying to upload my files and getting fustrated they were too small I googled it and learned you have to make your file four times the print size. Then I went back again and made changes so all four sides were on one image, that way I only had to pay for one upload. I used an email offer&amp;nbsp;for a 250 postcards for $5 to print the main STD and I placed an order right after that for 100 free postcards so I could get the RSVP. I paid an extra $11 to have the matte finish so everyone could write on them. I&amp;nbsp;uploaded our logo and made some stickers (so I could personalize the piggy banks), magnetic notepads, pens and t-shirts just because they were free. I ordered 100 of the plain white envelopes for about $4 extra and some free address labels that&amp;nbsp;matched pretty well.&amp;nbsp;I had a little freak out moment because placing this order meant this was real. The date was being published and this was really happening. I paid for 21 day slow shipping on three orders and&amp;nbsp;7 day&amp;nbsp;fast shipping on one order.&amp;nbsp;Three&amp;nbsp;orders with shipping was&amp;nbsp;about $60. &amp;nbsp;Then I just had to wait.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; In the meantime I worked on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-336\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00796.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00796\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Here\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s all the supplies (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This is what I was going for:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-337\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide91.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide9\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-358\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00804.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00804\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This was happy me two days before the stapler incident. (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00888.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00888\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I went out the next day and bought a long reach stapler and my&amp;nbsp;little cousin just had to help me! Yeah, that busted look&amp;nbsp;I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m sporting was because of being up from 2-7am addressing envelopes!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Because&amp;nbsp;it would take&amp;nbsp;between $4.80 and $6.00 to mail a box with a piggy bank I knew most people would be getting just the envelope mailed and the piggy bank hand delievered if possible.&amp;nbsp;I did my best to finish the envelopes first and then I had to force myself to to finish the luggage boxes. I got a spark of inspiration when I stumbled across a picture of a train case, and finished the outside of the boxes. Then I took the packing material I had been saving for months (my way of bring green) and packaged the piggy banks to get them ready to mail.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00913.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00913\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m almost done, did you ever spend so much time on a project you loved you started to hate looking at it?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608786,"PostDate":1334769723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Save the Date Journey: Designing, Ordering and Assembling<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 26, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> When I showed Raoul and his mother during my visit they were quite impressed. Raoul made me feel warm and fuzzy when he told me I continued to amaze him. I returned home determined to get them finished and sent out so everyone had plenty time to save up and get off work. I perfected the\u00a0passport pages\u00a0while waiting on a date so I could start printing. I decided to add some pictures since\u00a0a lot of my family and friends hadn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t seen Ra and I knew it would make the older guests happy.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-333\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/lpbackedit.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"lpbackedit\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> (Personal Image)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I left a space at the top to\u00a0add a magnet to it that way you could put it on your fridge but my face is hidden!\u00a0\u00a0Sorry, I had to remove our website. I needed to get an idea of who was really interested in coming for planning purposes and I remembered I had seen an early bird rsvp a girl had made while ago.\u00a0 I wanted the package to be fun and interactive and\u00a0I remembered\u00a0this image I had saved on my computer. Of course I couldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t find it and after persistent googling I found it again.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter\" height=\"435\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/4378714527_66ebf6eec5_z1.jpg?w=580&h=435\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" width=\"580\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/rsvpf.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpf\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-334\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/rsvpbedit.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpbedit\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span>(Personal Images)\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I loved it and I had hopes and dreams that I could collect sweet, meaningful messages and display them one day. I changed the address so you can see the pretty font, although it looks so much better with my address! By the way this was\u00a0like draft 12\u00a0and\u00a0I was so tired of looking at it.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> When we\u00a0finally got a date and I was able to\u00a0place my Vistaprint order. Oh, after three days of trying to upload my files and getting fustrated they were too small I googled it and learned you have to make your file four times the print size. Then I went back again and made changes so all four sides were on one image, that way I only had to pay for one upload. I used an email offer\u00a0for a 250 postcards for $5 to print the main STD and I placed an order right after that for 100 free postcards so I could get the RSVP. I paid an extra $11 to have the matte finish so everyone could write on them. I\u00a0uploaded our logo and made some stickers (so I could personalize the piggy banks), magnetic notepads, pens and t-shirts just because they were free. I ordered 100 of the plain white envelopes for about $4 extra and some free address labels that\u00a0matched pretty well.\u00a0I had a little freak out moment because placing this order meant this was real. The date was being published and this was really happening. I paid for 21 day slow shipping on three orders and\u00a07 day\u00a0fast shipping on one order.\u00a0Three\u00a0orders with shipping was\u00a0about $60. \u00a0Then I just had to wait.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> In the meantime I worked on the\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-336\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00796.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00796\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Here\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s all the supplies (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This is what I was going for:<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-337\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide91.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide9\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-358\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00804.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00804\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This was happy me two days before the stapler incident. (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00888.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00888\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I went out the next day and bought a long reach stapler and my\u00a0little cousin just had to help me! Yeah, that busted look\u00a0I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m sporting was because of being up from 2-7am addressing envelopes!\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Because\u00a0it would take\u00a0between $4.80 and $6.00 to mail a box with a piggy bank I knew most people would be getting just the envelope mailed and the piggy bank hand delievered if possible.\u00a0I did my best to finish the envelopes first and then I had to force myself to to finish the luggage boxes. I got a spark of inspiration when I stumbled across a picture of a train case, and finished the outside of the boxes. Then I took the packing material I had been saving for months (my way of bring green) and packaged the piggy banks to get them ready to mail.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00913.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00913\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m almost done, did you ever spend so much time on a project you loved you started to hate looking at it?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b22bd5559f330c382547a6399cbb65e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Save the Date Journey : Shopping and Designing&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 25, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;(I&#039;m sorry I got things out of order, this post should have gone before the last one)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; After I was more than inspired I started thinking about what I want my STD\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s to say to my guests. I wanted to be tactful but basically I wanted to say \u00e2\u20ac\u0153save your money and get your passport so you can come.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&amp;nbsp; The entire time I was dating Raoul I was always looking for someone to accompany me on a visit to the Bahamas. Problem was&amp;nbsp;finding someone with&amp;nbsp;their passport&amp;nbsp;and the money for the plane ticket. When people found out I was planning on going I&amp;nbsp;remembered saying over and over&amp;nbsp;\u00e2\u20ac\u009dSave your money and get your Passport.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I brainstormed about how to save this. Something about putting money in your piggy bank to prepare came to mind. Then I thought how cool would it be to have a \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Bahamas Fund\u00e2\u20ac\u009d piggy bank to inspire people to save for the trip. I did a lot of research for&amp;nbsp;little piggy banks and came across these.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-302\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/lil_saver_favor_l.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Lil_Saver_Favor_L\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-307\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/unique_home_decor_piggy_bank_01.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"unique_home_decor_piggy_bank_01\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-305\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/piggy-bank-clear-favor-box-2.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Piggy-Bank-Clear-Favor-Box-2\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-308\" height=\"340\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/qpic.jpg?w=512&amp;amp;h=340\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"QPic\" width=\"512\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-303\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/pid11424-recycled_cardboard_piggy_banks_wine_cork_screw_stopper_md.gif?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"pid11424-recycled_cardboard_piggy_banks_wine_cork_screw_stopper_md\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-309\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide11.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide1\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;I wanted you to feel like you could \u00e2\u20ac\u0153play\u00e2\u20ac\u009d. You would get a personalized golf pencil and three tiny magnets, one with our faces, one with our logo and one with a tiny seashell. I shopped online for tiny magnets, they wern\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t cheap and I hate paying shipping. I went to the craft stores and Wal-mart and found a few, good ole\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 Wal-mart was the cheapest. I found glass gems\/bubbles at the dollar store, both large and small. I originally planned to print the date on paper and make it another glass bubble but then I found wood disks&amp;nbsp;at a pretty good price on Etsy. I really wanted to incorporate wood. (I&amp;nbsp;LOVE wood, it reminds me&amp;nbsp;of going to the hardware store with my father as a little girl.)&amp;nbsp;This would make the project more expensive because I&amp;nbsp;would need to make a stamp to get the date&amp;nbsp;on. I&amp;nbsp;just needed shells.&amp;nbsp; Finding the right size was difficult. I spent hours and hours working on this project and I just wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t feeling it. It would be costly and time consuming. I played around with the cardboard postcard next.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-310\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide21.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide2\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I was really feeling this. I loved that it was green by using recycled cardboard. I loved that it contrasted the rough cardboard with the pretty lace. I loved that it was budget friendly! I bought some lace trim on ebay, ribbon at AC Moore cut up a shipping box and created a few mockups to try out the idea.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; (Personal Photo)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I showed my mother and she was concerned that I was not yet engaged and I was working so hard on this project, but she&amp;nbsp;loved it. I think her favorite part was that it was so inexpensive. I showed&amp;nbsp;the family I&amp;nbsp;work for&amp;nbsp;and they thought it was great. They even offered me a huge cardboard box that their futon came in. I had plenty of clean cardboard, I just needed labels and lace. The labels I found at office max. They weren\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t too expensive but they weren\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t cheap. I went to the fabric stores searching for lace. I could not find any I really liked at a good price. I figured out that I needed to be around $2 a yard and I went online in search of a good deal. It drove me crazy to choose something so important without seeing and feeling it. The lace was all different widths and I had to keep measuring to see what would fit with the labels. Frustrated I gave up.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; As you can see on the dates I was planning for a May wedding because I wanted to be ready. But&amp;nbsp;it was October and we hadn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t even&amp;nbsp;found out when my next vacation would be&amp;nbsp;yet so there was no promise of a ring yet. Plus I was busy with my mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s wedding coming up in November. So&amp;nbsp;the Save the Dates went on&amp;nbsp;pause.&amp;nbsp; Have you ever started a project and realized it would be too expensive to finish?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608790,"PostDate":1334770035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Save the Date Journey : Shopping and Designing<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 25, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">(I'm sorry I got things out of order, this post should have gone before the last one)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> After I was more than inspired I started thinking about what I want my STD\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s to say to my guests. I wanted to be tactful but basically I wanted to say \u00e2\u20ac\u0153save your money and get your passport so you can come.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\u00a0 The entire time I was dating Raoul I was always looking for someone to accompany me on a visit to the Bahamas. Problem was\u00a0finding someone with\u00a0their passport\u00a0and the money for the plane ticket. When people found out I was planning on going I\u00a0remembered saying over and over\u00a0\u00e2\u20ac\u009dSave your money and get your Passport.\u00e2\u20ac\u009d I brainstormed about how to save this. Something about putting money in your piggy bank to prepare came to mind. Then I thought how cool would it be to have a \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Bahamas Fund\u00e2\u20ac\u009d piggy bank to inspire people to save for the trip. I did a lot of research for\u00a0little piggy banks and came across these.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-302\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/lil_saver_favor_l.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Lil_Saver_Favor_L\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-307\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/unique_home_decor_piggy_bank_01.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"unique_home_decor_piggy_bank_01\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-305\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/piggy-bank-clear-favor-box-2.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Piggy-Bank-Clear-Favor-Box-2\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-308\" height=\"340\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/qpic.jpg?w=512&h=340\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"QPic\" width=\"512\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-303\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/pid11424-recycled_cardboard_piggy_banks_wine_cork_screw_stopper_md.gif?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"pid11424-recycled_cardboard_piggy_banks_wine_cork_screw_stopper_md\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-309\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide11.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide1\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0I wanted you to feel like you could \u00e2\u20ac\u0153play\u00e2\u20ac\u009d. You would get a personalized golf pencil and three tiny magnets, one with our faces, one with our logo and one with a tiny seashell. I shopped online for tiny magnets, they wern\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t cheap and I hate paying shipping. I went to the craft stores and Wal-mart and found a few, good ole\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 Wal-mart was the cheapest. I found glass gems\/bubbles at the dollar store, both large and small. I originally planned to print the date on paper and make it another glass bubble but then I found wood disks\u00a0at a pretty good price on Etsy. I really wanted to incorporate wood. (I\u00a0LOVE wood, it reminds me\u00a0of going to the hardware store with my father as a little girl.)\u00a0This would make the project more expensive because I\u00a0would need to make a stamp to get the date\u00a0on. I\u00a0just needed shells.\u00a0 Finding the right size was difficult. I spent hours and hours working on this project and I just wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t feeling it. It would be costly and time consuming. I played around with the cardboard postcard next.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-310\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/slide21.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide2\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I was really feeling this. I loved that it was green by using recycled cardboard. I loved that it contrasted the rough cardboard with the pretty lace. I loved that it was budget friendly! I bought some lace trim on ebay, ribbon at AC Moore cut up a shipping box and created a few mockups to try out the idea.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> (Personal Photo)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I showed my mother and she was concerned that I was not yet engaged and I was working so hard on this project, but she\u00a0loved it. I think her favorite part was that it was so inexpensive. I showed\u00a0the family I\u00a0work for\u00a0and they thought it was great. They even offered me a huge cardboard box that their futon came in. I had plenty of clean cardboard, I just needed labels and lace. The labels I found at office max. They weren\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t too expensive but they weren\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t cheap. I went to the fabric stores searching for lace. I could not find any I really liked at a good price. I figured out that I needed to be around $2 a yard and I went online in search of a good deal. It drove me crazy to choose something so important without seeing and feeling it. The lace was all different widths and I had to keep measuring to see what would fit with the labels. Frustrated I gave up.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> As you can see on the dates I was planning for a May wedding because I wanted to be ready. But\u00a0it was October and we hadn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t even\u00a0found out when my next vacation would be\u00a0yet so there was no promise of a ring yet. Plus I was busy with my mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s wedding coming up in November. So\u00a0the Save the Dates went on\u00a0pause.\u00a0 Have you ever started a project and realized it would be too expensive to finish?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4682e85b13b22c2bf24a6770d0b369d","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;You Can Do It, Put Your Back Into It&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 29, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; Alternative Titles: Girl, You Look Good, Won\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t You Back That Thang Up! and Baby, Got Back!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; For many men the booty is the most desirable body part on a woman is her booty. For me the most beautiful part is the back. At a wedding you spend a lot of time looking at the bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s back. Think about it, she walks down and your struggling to see her past everyone standing up. Unless there is some creative seating arrangement, throughout the ceremony you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re stuck staring at her back.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-507\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615509_hxyi2zxe_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615509_HXyi2ZXE_c\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Even at a Royal Wedding you get a rear view\/&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-510\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615611_ohs82wlm_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615611_OhS82WLm_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; That\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s&amp;nbsp;beautiful, but not jaw dropping remember I like to see&amp;nbsp;backs? \/&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-512\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615697_hrkrcnq6_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615697_HRkRCnQ6_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; More like it, I love the beading but a little too exposed for me\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-511\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615664_x7ykwef9_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615664_x7yKWef9_c\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;The lace is so pretty but the bow seems like it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s on the wrong dress\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-514\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487157_xvmh6yw7_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487157_XvMh6yW7_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This dress is all wrong for me but I love the lace pattern on her back (Really what woman wants a huge rose on her butt?)&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-516\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/230528074645526693_livw5ejr_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"230528074645526693_livw5EJr_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This was all kinds of perfect, Modest, Sweet and Stunning \/&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-515\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487165_2j7wupvy_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487165_2J7wuPvy_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Oh, so sexy and classy\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-517\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487167_fufnppnx_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487167_fuFNPpNX_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Pretty, Pretty, Pretty\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-519\" height=\"449\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/lace-back-wedding-dress-marchesa.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=449\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Print\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; The one on the left blows my mind with how simple and crazy hot the back&amp;nbsp; is (but why do they keep adding weird stuff on the butts?)&amp;nbsp;\/&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-513\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487150_jcoyewym_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487150_JCoyeWYM_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This is probably&amp;nbsp;one of the best&amp;nbsp;choices for me, I get to show off my back and still be classy and modest and I love the buttons and neckline\/&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-520\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615563_bywnjjtd_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615563_bYWNjjtD_c\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; This is one of those I had to see it so you do too, I know it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s your wedding lady, but seriously?&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.snopes.com\/photos\/risque\/weddingdress.asp\"&gt;Source&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; So the rules for my wedding dress shopping was:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;Backless detail but still modest \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Not marrying into the Duggar family modest but not so sexy I offend Grandma&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;Lace \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve discovered I&amp;nbsp;loved it and it felt bridal and vintage to me&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;Comfortable for the beach and dancing \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to spend money on something I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d only wear for a few hours, I wanted to be able to wear my dress all day&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt;Affordable \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I wanted to spend less than $1000 on my entire wardrobe for the day&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ol&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I had also plans of using my mothers first wedding dress somehow. I was inspired by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingbee.com\/2010\/06\/15\/wedding-shrug-bolero\/\"&gt;Mrs.Turtles\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 custom shrug&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and with that in the back of my mind set off dress shopping. Online of course because there was no ring yet. What body part did you want your wedidng dress to feature?&lt;\/p&gt;  &amp;nbsp;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608918,"PostDate":1334790233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">You Can Do It, Put Your Back Into It<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 29, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> Alternative Titles: Girl, You Look Good, Won\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t You Back That Thang Up! and Baby, Got Back!<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> For many men the booty is the most desirable body part on a woman is her booty. For me the most beautiful part is the back. At a wedding you spend a lot of time looking at the bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s back. Think about it, she walks down and your struggling to see her past everyone standing up. Unless there is some creative seating arrangement, throughout the ceremony you\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re stuck staring at her back.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-507\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615509_hxyi2zxe_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615509_HXyi2ZXE_c\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Even at a Royal Wedding you get a rear view\/<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-510\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615611_ohs82wlm_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615611_OhS82WLm_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> That\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s\u00a0beautiful, but not jaw dropping remember I like to see\u00a0backs? \/<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-512\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615697_hrkrcnq6_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615697_HRkRCnQ6_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> More like it, I love the beading but a little too exposed for me\/\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-511\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615664_x7ykwef9_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615664_x7yKWef9_c\" \/><\/span>\u00a0The lace is so pretty but the bow seems like it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s on the wrong dress\/\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-514\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487157_xvmh6yw7_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487157_XvMh6yW7_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This dress is all wrong for me but I love the lace pattern on her back (Really what woman wants a huge rose on her butt?)\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-516\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/230528074645526693_livw5ejr_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"230528074645526693_livw5EJr_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This was all kinds of perfect, Modest, Sweet and Stunning \/\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-515\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487165_2j7wupvy_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487165_2J7wuPvy_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Oh, so sexy and classy\/\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-517\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487167_fufnppnx_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487167_fuFNPpNX_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Pretty, Pretty, Pretty\/\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-519\" height=\"449\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/lace-back-wedding-dress-marchesa.jpg?w=640&h=449\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Print\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> The one on the left blows my mind with how simple and crazy hot the back\u00a0 is (but why do they keep adding weird stuff on the butts?)\u00a0\/<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-513\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844487150_jcoyewym_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844487150_JCoyeWYM_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This is probably\u00a0one of the best\u00a0choices for me, I get to show off my back and still be classy and modest and I love the buttons and neckline\/<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-520\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/125397170844615563_bywnjjtd_c.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"125397170844615563_bYWNjjtD_c\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> This is one of those I had to see it so you do too, I know it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s your wedding lady, but seriously?<a href='http:\/\/www.snopes.com\/photos\/risque\/weddingdress.asp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Source<\/a><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> So the rules for my wedding dress shopping was:<\/p> <ol style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 3.23em; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-type: decimal; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; \"> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \">Backless detail but still modest \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Not marrying into the Duggar family modest but not so sexy I offend Grandma<\/em><\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \">Lace \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve discovered I\u00a0loved it and it felt bridal and vintage to me<\/em><\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \">Comfortable for the beach and dancing \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to spend money on something I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122d only wear for a few hours, I wanted to be able to wear my dress all day<\/em><\/li> <li style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"> <em style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \">Affordable \u00e2\u20ac\u201c I wanted to spend less than $1000 on my entire wardrobe for the day<\/em><\/li> <\/ol> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I had also plans of using my mothers first wedding dress somehow. I was inspired by\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.weddingbee.com\/2010\/06\/15\/wedding-shrug-bolero\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Mrs.Turtles\u00e2\u20ac\u2122 custom shrug<\/a>\u00a0and with that in the back of my mind set off dress shopping. Online of course because there was no ring yet. What body part did you want your wedidng dress to feature?<\/p>  \u00a0\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24e9462e30aa5a0929fe19cd96e20a32","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Save The Date Journey: Get Them Out Of Here!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;January 31, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; The Save the Dates&amp;nbsp;are officially being mailed. No, there not all&amp;nbsp;sent and&amp;nbsp;I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll explain why in a minute. But I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so glad they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re gone. I had grown tired of looking at them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; It took&amp;nbsp;a week&amp;nbsp;to get address on them. Mostly because I needed my mothers help and we both have busy schedules. She called me to come over one night and she was in bed before 9. That might not be surprising to you but my family eats dinner at 9! Fustrated I just went to sleep there, I awoke to her checking on everyone at 2am with her burst of energy. She asked if I wanted her help and since I was awake I grabbed my stuff and went to her bed. This is what addressing STD\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s in the bed at 3 in the morning looks like:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-355\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00881.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00881\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00886.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00886\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; Beautiful, Hun? I kept reminding her I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t sleep for two&amp;nbsp;weeks&amp;nbsp;before her&amp;nbsp;wedding! (Personal Photos)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; I learned I super hate finding addresses. I now know why snail mail is a dying trend.&amp;nbsp;In a world where I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t remember all of my internet alpha numeric passowords how am I supposed to&amp;nbsp;keeps track of everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s address?! I tried to be proactive and&amp;nbsp;started to collect address from people I bumped into when I knew I was about to get the ring, but most of our family and friends live in different states. My mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s brain has somehow committed to memory quite a few addresses, but that was only for people who haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t moved in 10 or 12 years. What saved me from&amp;nbsp;giving up&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;a little trick my&amp;nbsp;mother taught me. I shouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t share because it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s one of those secrets that get passed down through the generations but you&amp;nbsp;might find helpful one day. Ok, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll share but keep it between us. Google them. I know, it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s crazy right! I had a why didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t I think of that moment (and you probably did too) The white pages website is like having a phone book for every state but without taking up space in your house. But this didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t give us all the ones we needed. It was a good thing I was only sending Save the Dates to the people I expected to need to make travel arrangements, I realized when it came time for the wedding invitations that you have to send to the older family members as a formality I was going to go through this all over again. I made a few phone calls to get some addresses and then realized we don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s current number.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; During this process I&amp;nbsp;also fell in love with&amp;nbsp;the guys at my post office. (Which reminds me I want to make them cookies or brownies..actually I should just take them candy because I wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t eat what kind strangers baked me.) They seriously are the nicest, most patient men. They have endured many long visits from me during this month. Let me illustrate.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-219\" height=\"896\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/postoffice_visits.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=896\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"postoffice_visits\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;Until them,&amp;nbsp;Ra was one of the few men who&amp;nbsp;would&amp;nbsp;watch me be crazy me and just smile and love me anyways. Maybe because it was their job, maybe because they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re just the most awesome post office guys ever.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-423\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00813.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00813\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; A look at my new stamp collection&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; \"&gt; So&amp;nbsp;since they have not been mailed to everyone I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to reveal the full package just yet, but I can tease you with a sneak peek.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-220\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00841.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00841\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-221\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc008941.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00894\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-222\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00915.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00915\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; All Photos Personal&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I know your dying to see. Soon, very soon.&amp;nbsp; Was it really a secret tip or have you used whitepages.com before?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608919,"PostDate":1334790589,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Save The Date Journey: Get Them Out Of Here!<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">January 31, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> The Save the Dates\u00a0are officially being mailed. No, there not all\u00a0sent and\u00a0I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll explain why in a minute. But I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m so glad they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re gone. I had grown tired of looking at them.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> It took\u00a0a week\u00a0to get address on them. Mostly because I needed my mothers help and we both have busy schedules. She called me to come over one night and she was in bed before 9. That might not be surprising to you but my family eats dinner at 9! Fustrated I just went to sleep there, I awoke to her checking on everyone at 2am with her burst of energy. She asked if I wanted her help and since I was awake I grabbed my stuff and went to her bed. This is what addressing STD\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s in the bed at 3 in the morning looks like:<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-355\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00881.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00881\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00886.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00886\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> Beautiful, Hun? I kept reminding her I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t sleep for two\u00a0weeks\u00a0before her\u00a0wedding! (Personal Photos)<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> I learned I super hate finding addresses. I now know why snail mail is a dying trend.\u00a0In a world where I can\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t remember all of my internet alpha numeric passowords how am I supposed to\u00a0keeps track of everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s address?! I tried to be proactive and\u00a0started to collect address from people I bumped into when I knew I was about to get the ring, but most of our family and friends live in different states. My mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s brain has somehow committed to memory quite a few addresses, but that was only for people who haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t moved in 10 or 12 years. What saved me from\u00a0giving up\u00a0was\u00a0a little trick my\u00a0mother taught me. I shouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t share because it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s one of those secrets that get passed down through the generations but you\u00a0might find helpful one day. Ok, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ll share but keep it between us. Google them. I know, it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s crazy right! I had a why didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t I think of that moment (and you probably did too) The white pages website is like having a phone book for every state but without taking up space in your house. But this didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t give us all the ones we needed. It was a good thing I was only sending Save the Dates to the people I expected to need to make travel arrangements, I realized when it came time for the wedding invitations that you have to send to the older family members as a formality I was going to go through this all over again. I made a few phone calls to get some addresses and then realized we don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t have everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s current number.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> During this process I\u00a0also fell in love with\u00a0the guys at my post office. (Which reminds me I want to make them cookies or brownies..actually I should just take them candy because I wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t eat what kind strangers baked me.) They seriously are the nicest, most patient men. They have endured many long visits from me during this month. Let me illustrate.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-219\" height=\"896\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/postoffice_visits.jpg?w=640&h=896\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"postoffice_visits\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span>\u00a0Until them,\u00a0Ra was one of the few men who\u00a0would\u00a0watch me be crazy me and just smile and love me anyways. Maybe because it was their job, maybe because they\u00e2\u20ac\u2122re just the most awesome post office guys ever.<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-423\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/01\/dsc00813.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00813\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> A look at my new stamp collection<\/p> <p align=\"center\"  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px\"> So\u00a0since they have not been mailed to everyone I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to reveal the full package just yet, but I can tease you with a sneak peek.\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-220\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00841.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00841\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-221\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc008941.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00894\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-222\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00915.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00915\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> All Photos Personal<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I know your dying to see. Soon, very soon.\u00a0 Was it really a secret tip or have you used whitepages.com before?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b4f230c3d16ed945b737a17f6714863","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Amber - What a great blog! Lot&#039;s of helpful information and I loved reading your story. TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1608980,"PostDate":1334799345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Amber - What a great blog! Lot's of helpful information and I loved reading your story. TA Patty<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read o