s","JoinDate":1278661080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fea0f65e05df34b8b7c0092af59d3572","RawContent":"Thanks Patty! It&#039;s nice to finally see your face!  [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]TA Patty[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Amber - What a great blog! Lot&#039;s of helpful information and I loved reading your story. TA Patty[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1608990,"PostDate":1334800455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Patty! It's nice to finally see your face!\u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>TA Patty<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Amber - What a great blog! Lot's of helpful information and I loved reading your story. TA Patty<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e49b350b0c0d7a84184ed7842423f7b6","RawContent":"Hi Dominiqueamber! Loved reading your blog, looking forward to more updates! Love your ring, very unique which I love. I didn&#039;t go with my fianc\u00a9 to pick my ring, he did it on his own. I must say he did a pretty good job! Oh and that pic of that bride....Yikes!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1609100,"PostDate":1334843326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Dominiqueamber! Loved reading your blog, looking forward to more updates! Love your ring, very unique which I love. I didn't go with my fianc\u00a9 to pick my ring, he did it on his own. I must say he did a pretty good job! Oh and that pic of that bride....Yikes!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Marrying my best friend on October 6th, 2012 at the Riu Ocho Rios!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jayetee73@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1297347229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236623.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Blujaye","Id":236623,"Name":"Blujaye","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"049c146d431827e2ccf91947dbc625e9","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Blujaye[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi Dominiqueamber!\n Loved reading your blog, looking forward to more updates!\n Love your ring, very unique which I love. I didn&#039;t go with my fianc\u00a9 to pick my ring, he did it on his own. I must say he did a pretty good job!\n Oh and that pic of that bride....Yikes!![\/quote] \n \n Thanks Blujaye! Its a nice feeling other people are interested in my wedding details. I really love my ring, I&#039;m anxious to have six bands because it looked so hot in the store, ut I have to be patient so they each have meaning. Did you drop any hints for your fianc\u00a9? I googled worst brides dresses (or something like that)  and a few others similar came up!","Attachments":[],"Id":1609103,"PostDate":1334844055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Blujaye<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi Dominiqueamber!<br \/> Loved reading your blog, looking forward to more updates!<br \/> Love your ring, very unique which I love. I didn't go with my fianc\u00a9 to pick my ring, he did it on his own. I must say he did a pretty good job!<br \/> Oh and that pic of that bride....Yikes!!<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks Blujaye! Its a nice feeling other people are interested in my wedding details. I really love my ring, I'm anxious to have six bands because it looked so hot in the store, ut I have to be patient so they each have meaning. Did you drop any hints for your fianc\u00a9? I googled worst brides dresses (or something like that) \u00a0and a few others similar came up!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c2efe07afa7ae3a2866a74af9cf40f3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dominiqueamber\"]\nThanks Blujaye! Its a nice feeling other people are interested in my wedding details. I really love my ring, I&#039;m anxious to have six bands because it looked so hot in the store, ut I have to be patient so they each have meaning. Did you drop any hints for your fianc\u00a9? I googled worst brides dresses (or something like that)  and a few others similar came up! [\/quote] The rings look great in the photos! I have been dropping hints since the third year we were together! We had even gone ring shopping the year before he finally proposed. The one I had liked was out of his price range but the one he got in the end was perfect. For me it has a lot of meaning because he put so much thought and love into it! Keep up the good work!","Attachments":[],"Id":1609549,"PostDate":1334929035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"dominiqueamber\" url=\"\/t\/79241\/dominiqueambers&#045;wedding&#045;planning&#045;blog\/10#post_1758671\"><p>Thanks Blujaye! Its a nice feeling other people are interested in my wedding details. I really love my ring, I'm anxious to have six bands because it looked so hot in the store, ut I have to be patient so they each have meaning. Did you drop any hints for your fianc\u00a9? I googled worst brides dresses (or something like that) \u00a0and a few others similar came up!\u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> The rings look great in the photos! I have been dropping hints since the third year we were together! We had even gone ring shopping the year before he finally proposed. The one I had liked was out of his price range but the one he got in the end was perfect. For me it has a lot of meaning because he put so much thought and love into it! Keep up the good work!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Marrying my best friend on October 6th, 2012 at the Riu Ocho Rios!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jayetee73@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1297347229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236623.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Blujaye","Id":236623,"Name":"Blujaye","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66973,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3192aa390e9303dee036f65851083dac","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Save the Date Journey: The Big Reveal&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;February 4, 2012&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; You\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve waited long enough, it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s time to reveal my precious baby! Here are our Save the Dates!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Most everyone recieved a kraft envelope with a \u00e2\u20ac\u0153luggage tag\u00e2\u20ac\u009d with their name and address on it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-383\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00895edit.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00895edit\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;I had to take out the address but I was so happy to have my mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s handwriting on my Save the Dates. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve always loved her handwriting so this was more precious to me than calligraphy. The envelopes had a Love stamp and a Disney stamp. I loved the Up stamp but my favorite version&amp;nbsp;had a&amp;nbsp;Green stamp and a Wall-E stamp.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; What\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s inside?&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-372\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc008471.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00847\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; The STD postcard comes first, followed by the Early Bird RSVP and then the Passport of travel details&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-375\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00853.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00853\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; And if you recieved a larger package in the mail it looked like this\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-385\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00914edit.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00914edit\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I used a combination of stamps I liked to acheive the collected, vintage stamp look.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-395\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc009161.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00916\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; To be green, instead of buying new packing materials I&amp;nbsp;stuffed the boxes with various packaging materials I had saved from bubble wrap, to peanuts, to newspaper to tissue paper. In addition to the envelope pictured above guests recieved one of three different piggy banks inside their box. Each piggy had a label with our logo that said \u00e2\u20ac\u0153It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Better in The Bahamas\u00e2\u20ac\u009d&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-397\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00932.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00932\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; And the final package\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00923.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00923\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); \"&gt;I&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;was very proud of how well it all came together despite the little hiccups.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Here\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a detail of the contents:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Front of the STD&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-lef