al initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpbedit\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Passport Pages&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-398\" height=\"450\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide15.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=450\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide1\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; The first page of the real Passport had a picture that represented the country and an intent for the purpose of travel. I decided to use a picture of us and a scripture that I felt was the intent for the purpose of our wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-399\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide21.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide2\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I turned this page so you can read it correctly but it is turned the way a real passport booklet is. On the US Passport it features an eagle and the Constitution. I used a conch shell since it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s our symbol and rewrote a Constitution for our United State of Marriage. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to use United States because I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to favor my country over his. I did my best to make it look&amp;nbsp; realistic.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-400\" height=\"460\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide31.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=460\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide3\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; I wanted to have a page that looked like passport stamps, so I put some travel details like the Travel Agents contact information in a few faux passport stamps. You wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t believe some of the questions I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve gotten about Bahamas. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t realize how little Americans know about what\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s outside our country until I started dating Ra. About 70% of people think Bahamas and Jamacia are the same, they ask me what language they speak there and they want to know why they need a passport since it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s US territory. To be honest I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t know all of this information but I wanted to answer a lot of the questions I get asked often and make guests feel comfortable knowing a little something about the foreign land they are traveling to.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-401\" height=\"449\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide41.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=449\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide4\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Because convenience was important to me I wanted to give everyone the option of flying down or traveling on a cruise ship since they wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need a passport. I put the necessary information for flying and cruising on the next two pages, directing them to the website for more details. My favorite part is the little line that says it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s either the least expensive option or gives you more time in Nassau.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-402\" height=\"444\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide51.jpg?w=640&amp;amp;h=444\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide5\" width=\"640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; Because quotes and poems are important to both of us I wanted to include a poem that was special to me and described how I felt about marrying Ra.&amp;nbsp;After working on it for a month I&amp;nbsp;felt so proud of this little passport. I felt so proud of the entire Save the Date package. I hope my family and friends are surprised by the package,&amp;nbsp;appreciate it and are motivated to make the trip. Have you ever recieved an unexpected package in the mail that made you smile?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.615em; margin-left: 0px; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center; \"&gt; All Photos are Personal&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609559,"PostDate":1334930386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Save the Date Journey: The Big Reveal<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\">February 4, 2012<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> You\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve waited long enough, it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s time to reveal my precious baby! Here are our Save the Dates!<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Most everyone recieved a kraft envelope with a \u00e2\u20ac\u0153luggage tag\u00e2\u20ac\u009d with their name and address on it.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-383\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00895edit.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00895edit\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0I had to take out the address but I was so happy to have my mother\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s handwriting on my Save the Dates. I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve always loved her handwriting so this was more precious to me than calligraphy. The envelopes had a Love stamp and a Disney stamp. I loved the Up stamp but my favorite version\u00a0had a\u00a0Green stamp and a Wall-E stamp.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> What\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s inside?<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-372\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc008471.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00847\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> The STD postcard comes first, followed by the Early Bird RSVP and then the Passport of travel details<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-375\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00853.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00853\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> And if you recieved a larger package in the mail it looked like this\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-385\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00914edit.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00914edit\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I used a combination of stamps I liked to acheive the collected, vintage stamp look.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-395\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc009161.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00916\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> To be green, instead of buying new packing materials I\u00a0stuffed the boxes with various packaging materials I had saved from bubble wrap, to peanuts, to newspaper to tissue paper. In addition to the envelope pictured above guests recieved one of three different piggy banks inside their box. Each piggy had a label with our logo that said \u00e2\u20ac\u0153It\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Better in The Bahamas\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-397\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00932.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00932\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> And the final package\u00e2\u20ac\u00a6<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"480\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/dsc00923.jpg?w=640&h=480\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 99.25%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"DSC00923\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">I<\/span>\u00a0was very proud of how well it all came together despite the little hiccups.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Here\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s a detail of the contents:<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Front of the STD<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-386\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/lp.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"lp\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Back of the STD (includes a magnet)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-387\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/lpbackedit.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"lpbackedit\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Front of the Early Bird RSVP<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-389\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/rsvpf.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpf\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Back of the Early Bird RSVP (with edits to the address)<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-388\" height=\"496\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/rsvpbedit.jpg?w=640&h=496\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"rsvpbedit\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Passport Pages<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-398\" height=\"450\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide15.jpg?w=640&h=450\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide1\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> The first page of the real Passport had a picture that represented the country and an intent for the purpose of travel. I decided to use a picture of us and a scripture that I felt was the intent for the purpose of our wedding.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-399\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide21.jpg?w=640\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide2\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I turned this page so you can read it correctly but it is turned the way a real passport booklet is. On the US Passport it features an eagle and the Constitution. I used a conch shell since it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s our symbol and rewrote a Constitution for our United State of Marriage. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to use United States because I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t want to favor my country over his. I did my best to make it look\u00a0 realistic.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-400\" height=\"460\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide31.jpg?w=640&h=460\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide3\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> I wanted to have a page that looked like passport stamps, so I put some travel details like the Travel Agents contact information in a few faux passport stamps. You wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t believe some of the questions I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122ve gotten about Bahamas. I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t realize how little Americans know about what\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s outside our country until I started dating Ra. About 70% of people think Bahamas and Jamacia are the same, they ask me what language they speak there and they want to know why they need a passport since it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s US territory. To be honest I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t know all of this information but I wanted to answer a lot of the questions I get asked often and make guests feel comfortable knowing a little something about the foreign land they are traveling to.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-401\" height=\"449\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide41.jpg?w=640&h=449\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide4\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Because convenience was important to me I wanted to give everyone the option of flying down or traveling on a cruise ship since they wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t need a passport. I put the necessary information for flying and cruising on the next two pages, directing them to the website for more details. My favorite part is the little line that says it\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s either the least expensive option or gives you more time in Nassau.<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-402\" height=\"444\" src=\"http:\/\/raoulandamberinlove.files.wordpress.com\/2012\/02\/slide51.jpg?w=640&h=444\" style=\"border-top-width: 1px; border-right-width: 1px; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-left-width: 1px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; clear: both; display: block; margin-top: 0.8075em; margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 0.8075em; margin-left: auto; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-right-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-bottom-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); border-left-color: rgb(187, 187, 187); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-bottom: 1px; padding-left: 1px; height: auto; width: auto; background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial; \" title=\"Slide5\" width=\"640\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> Because quotes and poems are important to both of us I wanted to include a poem that was special to me and described how I felt about marrying Ra.\u00a0After working on it for a month I\u00a0felt so proud of this little passport. I felt so proud of the entire Save the Date package. I hope my family and friends are surprised by the package,\u00a0appreciate it and are motivated to make the trip. Have you ever recieved an unexpected package in the mail that made you smile?<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family: inherit;font-size: 15px;font-style: inherit;font-weight: inherit;margin-left: 0px;text-align: center\"> All Photos are Personal<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278382504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":87,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
