00-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797<\/a>","Email":"daisy.pitre@gmail.com","IpAddress":"142.255.87.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414964723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Janjin","Id":280967,"Name":"Janjin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.86.124.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79567,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ffa62ff559b6e8a0da358d53a683120","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think that&#039;s what I will be doing...going with the 2 and then if i want in the future I can add the 3rd.&amp;nbsp; Thanks ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904323,"PostDate":1441735170,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think that's what I will be doing...going with the 2 and then if i want in the future I can add the 3rd.\u00a0 Thanks ladies!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79575-rivierabrides-planning-thread-102715\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t