 in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> or my wedding band (this is actually a really pretty ring but this image is awful!)<br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"Times New Roman\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/111457e2280cc2f4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/font><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> But I don't ever wear them together. Also, my Ering is still way too big even though I had it sized once. I just don't have time to deal with it, though!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Shawn and NatashaHappily MarriedNovember 11, 2006<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"xtra858sd@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1143539820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206727.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NATASHA","Id":206727,"Name":"NATASHA","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2110,"TotalPages":211,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":2100},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
