{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.2.49.178","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79953,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1032df448cf199a1b7f460e9e6f45654","RawContent":"@[member=\"Cablelove11\"] here&#039;s a site that shows you how to build both!  [url=\"http:\/\/www.afloral.com\/Wedding-Design-Ideas\"]http:\/\/www.afloral.com\/Wedding-Design-Ideas[\/url]\n\nHope that helps!\n[quote name=\"Cablelove11\" post=\"1911783\" timestamp=\"1457744341\"]\nCan any diy brides share some tips on making your own bouquets and boutinnaires? Making mine is definitely a cost saver, however the task seems daunting[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1912088,"PostDate":1458606534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282063\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282063-cablelove11\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cablelove11<\/span><\/a> here's a site that shows you how to build both! \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.afloral.com\/Wedding-Design-Ideas' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.afloral.c...ng-Design-Ideas<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Cablelove11, on 11 March 2016 - 05:59 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Can any diy brides share some tips on making your own bouquets and boutinnaires? Making mine is definitely a cost saver, however the task seems daunting<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jess<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79659-jes0912-moon-palace-planning-thread\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79659-jes0912-moon-palace-planning-thread\/<\/a>","Email":"jessica.so@icloud.com","IpAddress":"70.36.49.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444282103,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"jes0912","Id":285044,"Name":"jes0912","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.157.81.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79953,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"898c1dd5c6fdefa8e9df8099c5296a4f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"alongcamepauline\" post=\"1911517\" timestamp=\"1456956835\"]\n[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1911180\" timestamp=\"1456170936\"]\nHello,\n\nI actually brought my own bouquets\/boutonnieres etc. I went through an Etsy vendor called stemple shop. I ordered bouquets of real touch peonies. \n\nIt&#039;s definitely possible to bring your own flowers and it will save you a lot of money! Mine packed really easily and when I unpacked them they were fine, they weren&#039;t squished at all.[\/quote]Can I asked how you packed them? Did u keep them in the original packaging from stemple shop or repack it? Just curious.  I&#039;m really worried about traveling with bouquets\n\nSent from my HTC One_M8 using Tapatalk[\/quote]Hello is stemple shop still available on etsy? I tried searching it but it comes up as not available. \n\nThanks\nNatasha \n[quote name=\"jes0912\" post=\"1911187\" timestamp=\"1456188263\"]\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;Hi @[member=\"banana2016\"]&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;&amp;amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;I&#039;m also doing the same-- I&#039;m buying the silk\/fake flowers from a wholesaler here in Vancouver and assembling the bouquets myself. I&#039;ve youtubed it as well and it honestly doesn&#039;t look TOO difficult. I also want peonies which are super expensive down in Mexico so we&#039;ve opted for the silk flowers instead ;)&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;&amp;amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;Hope that helps!&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;[\/quote] \nHi can you please tell approximately how much your silk flowers for the bouquets cost? Looking to do the same thing \n\nThanks\nNatasha","Attachments":[],"Id":1912119,"PostDate":1458706493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>alongcamepauline, on 02 March 2016 - 03:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><\/p><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"perianjay\" data-cid=\"1911180\" data-time=\"1456170936\"><p>\nHello,<br><br>\nI actually brought my own bouquets\/boutonnieres etc. I went through an Etsy vendor called stemple shop. I ordered bouquets of real touch peonies. <br><br>\nIt's definitely possible to bring your own flowers and it will save you a lot of money! Mine packed really easily and when I unpacked them they were fine, they weren't squished at all.<\/p><\/div><\/div>Can I asked how you packed them? Did u keep them in the original packaging from stemple shop or repack it? Just curious.  I'm really worried about traveling with bouquets<br><br>\nSent from my HTC One_M8 using Tapatalk<\/blockquote>\n<br>\nHello is stemple shop still available on etsy? I tried searching it but it comes up as not available. <br><br>\nThanks<br>\nNatasha <br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jes0912, on 22 February 2016 - 05:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281935\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281935-banana2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">banana2016<\/span><\/a><\/p><br>\n<p>&amp;nbsp;<\/p><br>\n<p>I'm also doing the same-- I'm buying the silk\/fake flowers from a wholesaler here in Vancouver and assembling the bouquets myself. I've youtubed it as well and it honestly doesn't look TOO difficult. I also want peonies which are super expensive down in Mexico so we've opted for the silk flowers instead <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p><br>\n<p>&amp;nbsp;<\/p><br>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n <br>\nHi can you please tell approximately how much your silk flowers for the bouquets cost? Looking to do the same thing <br><br>\nThanks<br>\nNatasha \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nsramsingh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.114.203.239","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454211522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Natasha28","Id":286090,"Name":"Natasha28","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
