ck the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/callalillies5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n \n and for the bouquet...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/wedding234.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/callaliliies3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":178243,"PostDate":1201424046,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                what i would want for my center pieces<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/callallillies2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/callalillies5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> and for the bouquet...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/wedding234.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i37.photobucket.com\/albums\/e83\/cuata2pink\/callaliliies3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cuata2pink@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1194070799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207898.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":183,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cuata2pink","Id":207898,"Name":"cuata2pink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75a264800d8db3c730ac6a3ebf17f8c6","RawContent":"I finally got some good pics of mine so I wanted to share. Hope they help!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/center.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/247250045-M.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":178249,"PostDate":1201425461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I finally got some good pics of mine so I wanted to share. Hope they help!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/center.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/247250045-M.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katesig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.247.242.206","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154937300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206773.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"-Kate-","Id":206773,"Name":"-Kate-","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db1a237f85212a923bdc8f492d7a834e","RawContent":"Ooh Carly, I love your votives. Where did you get them? \n \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;carlymcmullen&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Well, still don&#039;t know how many people we will have, but here are some of my inspiration photos. I bought a bunch of these votives...\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Table%20Settings\/BOUGHT-bluevotive.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Table%20Settings\/BOUGHT-orangevotive.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Table%20Settings\/BOUGHT-pinkvotive.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":178315,"PostDate":1201464641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ooh Carly, I love your votives. Where did you get them? <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>carlymcmullen<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Well, still don't know how many people we will have, but here are some of my inspiration photos. I bought a bunch of these votives...<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Table%20Settings\/BOUGHT-bluevotive.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Table%20Settings\/BOUGHT-orangevotive.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/Table%20Settings\/BOUGHT-pinkvotive.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i206.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb160\/babycow_bucket\/Wedding\/TIMANDERICA_242.jpg\">http:\/\/i206.photobucket.com\/albums\/b...DERICA_242.jpg<\/a><br><strong>Erica and Tim<br>Dreams Tulum<br>Mexico<br>May 17, 2008<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"celanan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1184459272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207536.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"babycow","Id":207536,"Name":"babycow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3311e30bf326b1ffde0db8e8b776061","RawContent":"I think I am going to have this...not really a centrepiece as such but there are only going to be a few of us so i&#039;m going kinda simple...hopefully it doesn&#039;t look tacky?....\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2015.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n (dont mind the wrinkly tablecloth...just using it for a trial pic, lol)\n \n I also have a few of these candles but don&#039;t know if i&#039;ll use them b\/c frankly I don&#039;t know where I would use them...&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/candles.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":178494,"PostDate":1201481117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think I am going to have this...not really a centrepiece as such but there are only going to be a few of us so i'm going kinda simple...hopefully it doesn't look tacky?....<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2015.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> (dont mind the wrinkly tablecloth...just using it for a trial pic, lol)<br \/> <br \/> I also have a few of these candles but don't know if i'll use them b\/c frankly I don't know where I would use them...<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/candles.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"corinahenstridge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1189979099,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207745.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"newfiebride","Id":207745,"Name":"newfiebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f18ab265ba4150acc188c070cf10504b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;LALA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I finally got some good pics of mine so I wanted to share. Hope they help!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/center.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/247250045-M.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Oh I just love your tables, Kate! That looks sensational!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":178504,"PostDate":1201481458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LALA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I finally got some good pics of mine so I wanted to share. Hope they help!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/center.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i181.photobucket.com\/albums\/x310\/katesig78\/247250045-M.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Oh I just love your tables, Kate! That looks sensational!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177660740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"428a1d1b016df6a14760a2c4562e9ddc","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n I think it looks really cute! Nice and simple. I love the blue&#039;s... is that sea glass or rocks or something? Also where did you get the plates?","Attachments":[],"Id":178524,"PostDate":1201482531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I think it looks really cute! Nice and simple. I love the blue's... is that sea glass or rocks or something? Also where did you get the plates?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bnagan09@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.195.38.131","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1196758598,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208004.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bride010101","Id":208004,"Name":"Bride010101","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca9f0875690bd3e37694934a9e18aa79","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;naga0066&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n I think it looks really cute! Nice and simple. I love the blue&#039;s... is that sea glass or rocks or something? Also where did you get the plates?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n It&#039;s just blue rocks. And the plates came from a local store that carried weddingstar products.\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingstar.com\/us\/7076+Starfish+Glass+Candle+Holders+%2F+Dishes_refine:423;\"&gt;Weddingstar United States: Starfish Glass Candle Holders \/ Dishes&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":178533,"PostDate":1201482910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>naga0066<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i230.photobucket.com\/albums\/ee11\/newfiebride\/IMG_2016.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I think it looks really cute! Nice and simple. I love the blue's... is that sea glass or rocks or something? Also where did you get the plates?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> It's just blue rocks. And the plates came from a local store that carried weddingstar products.<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.weddingstar.com\/us\/7076+Starfish+Glass+Candle+Holders+%2F+Dishes_refine:423;' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Weddingstar United States: Starfish Glass Candle Holders \/ Dishes<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"corinahenstridge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1189979099,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207745.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"newfiebride","Id":207745,"Name":"newfiebride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75d01865162590268062220c795a2c06","RawContent":"Kate, I love your tablescape! Did you bring your them from home or did you find the vases in Cabo?","Attachments":[],"Id":178538,"PostDate":1201483590,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Kate, I love your tablescape! Did you bring your them from home or did you find the vases in Cabo?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Photo by <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog'>www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/amyhs-planning-galore-24132\/index10.html'>Planning Pics!<\/a> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/amyhs-puerto-vallarta-wedding-more-review-works-25255\/index4.html'>PV and Wedding Review<\/a><strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures?authkey=w0DgS3ao1sI#'>Pro Pics (1)<\/a>; <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures2?authkey=vbG3xUMVk1s#'>Pro Pics (2)<\/a><\/strong> <strong class='bbc'>By Nataly Lemus Photography and Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/strong> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/natalylemusphoto.blogspot.com\/2008\/07\/amy-hanssel-married.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Nataly Lemus Photogaphy<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.arpiaphotoblog.com\/2008\/07\/puerto-vallarta-destination-wedding_3102.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/a>","Email":"amyhmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.119.192.139","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1162175640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206875.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyh","Id":206875,"Name":"amyh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"594b6db9fca11fbcb492731fece1809c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;amyh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Kate, I love your tablescape! Did you bring your them from home or did you find the vases in Cabo?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks! The vases Maye had made for me in MX. The mold was $18 and each one cost $12. Totally worth it in my opinion. We actually brought one back home with us we liked them so much. \n We brought down the coral, the red votives, and the table numbers and their holders.","Attachments":[],"Id":178635,"PostDate":1201492396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>amyh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Kate, I love your tablescape! Did you bring your them from home or did you find the vases in Cabo?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks! The vases Maye had made for me in MX. The mold was $18 and each one cost $12. Totally worth it in my opinion. We actually brought one back home with us we liked them so much. <br \/> We brought down the coral, the red votives, and the table numbers and their holders.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katesig@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.247.242.206","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154937300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206773.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"-Kate-","Id":206773,"Name":"-Kate-","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b67d0114f8e367f11437414d935472e7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;LALA&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks! The vases Maye had made for me in MX. The mold was $18 and each one cost $12. Totally worth it in my opinion. We actually brought one back home with us we liked them so much. \n We brought down the coral, the red votives, and the table numbers and their holders.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I especially love the coral!","Attachments":[],"Id":178656,"PostDate":1201494657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LALA<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks! The vases Maye had made for me in MX. The mold was $18 and each one cost $12. Totally worth it in my opinion. We actually brought one back home with us we liked them so much. <br \/> We brought down the coral, the red votives, and the table numbers and their holders.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I especially love the coral!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177660740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"6277","Title":"Post your centerpieces here","LastPostDate":1456553575},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1354,"TotalPages":136,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":1350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
