we are doing shells and sand instead. These flowers are supposed to do well in the heat of Nicaragua.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844064,"PostDate":1397337570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74895-centerpiece\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17646\/sml_gallery_277561_17646_4909.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='centerpiece'  width='134' height='200'  alt='centerpiece' id='sml_image_view_74895' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is going to be my centerpiece, but I'm not into the apples, so we are doing shells and sand instead. These flowers are supposed to do well in the heat of Nicaragua.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bel.maria.g@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.77.139.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397335710,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277561.jpg?_r=1401300550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"cubanaboliviana","Id":277561,"Name":"cubanaboliviana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6289108a20b75d5b8af5c7fc19461889","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The centerpieces should be one of the focal points of your wedding day not only because they represent a great decorative item, but also because you can wear your style all through them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here I leave a centerpiece which personally is one of my favorites, &amp;nbsp;\u00a1ENJOY IT!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844443,"PostDate":1397578199,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The centerpieces should be one of the focal points of your wedding day not only because they represent a great decorative item, but also because you can wear your style all through them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here I leave a centerpiece which personally is one of my favorites, \u00a0\u00a1ENJOY IT!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1844443]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-238129-0-41840600-1397574553.jpg\" title=\"_A5A4875.JPG -  140.7KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-238129-0-41840600-1397574553.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"_A5A4875.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"octavio@momocode.com","IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1301000847,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238129.png?_r=1394907225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"omontes","Id":238129,"Name":"omontes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.162.162.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28cf0088838a56783497613b414f645d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So many pretty options :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880702,"PostDate":1418878171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So many pretty options <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vsschick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.208.80.15","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404487910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"vsschick1234","Id":278832,"Name":"vsschick1234","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.77.238.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2dbe5ffe17046d5ffbc79601da7389d","RawContent":"Hi i need suggestions for center pieces I wanted to use blue and clear water pearls with blue under water lights in 3 cylinder vases of different sizes but just that looks plain can anyone suggest what else I can add to this that I can take with me to Mexico...? I was going to add a photo of what I have but it&#039;s been disabled.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nI should also mention my fianc\u00e9e and I dislike tall center pieces that obscure the people right across the table from you.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1880880,"PostDate":1419207283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi i need suggestions for center pieces I wanted to use blue and clear water pearls with blue under water lights in 3 cylinder vases of different sizes but just that looks plain can anyone suggest what else I can add to this that I can take with me to Mexico...? I was going to add a photo of what I have but it's been disabled.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>I should also mention my fianc\u00e9e and I dislike tall center pieces that obscure the people right across the table from you.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kary.stuart@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.77.238.128","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419206461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kathryn77","Id":281461,"Name":"kathryn77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.172.7.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"894c47a85fcff930230df5d714822562","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey brides I&#039;m getting married on May 1st 2015 at the Azul Fives Hotel in Riviera Maya, Mexico!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Because of the weather, there&#039;s not a lot of variety in flower types and they have to import them, so that makes them so expensive!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found out a way to have centerpieces with less flowers, but really pretty! and cheap!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hired ANHEXO&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ANHEXOAmbientacionyMobiliario&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ANHEXOAmbientacionyMobiliario&lt;\/a&gt;and they are making them for me! &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If it&#039;s useful for you, here it&#039;s my blog&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/113-step-by-step-azul-fives-hotel-2015\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/113-step-by-step-azul-fives-hotel-2015\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":30259,"Name":"Screen Shot 2014-12-23 at 12.40.55 PM.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279051-0-74822600-1419360108.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279051-0-74822600-1419360108_thumb.png","Width":515,"Height":225},{"Id":30260,"Name":"Screen Shot 2014-12-23 at 12.41.04 PM.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279051-0-65009400-1419360125.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279051-0-65009400-1419360125_thumb.png","Width":471,"Height":368},{"Id":30261,"Name":"Screen Shot 2014-12-23 at 12.41.18 PM.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279051-0-87095800-1419360137.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279051-0-87095800-1419360137_thumb.png","Width":370,"Height":421}],"Id":1881048,"PostDate":1419363743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey brides I'm getting married on May 1st 2015 at the Azul Fives Hotel in Riviera Maya, Mexico!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Because of the weather, there's not a lot of variety in flower types and they have to import them, so that makes them so expensive!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found out a way to have centerpieces with less flowers, but really pretty! and cheap!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hired ANHEXO\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ANHEXOAmbientacionyMobiliario' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...cionyMobiliario<\/a>and they are making them for me! <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If it's useful for you, here it's my blog<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/113-step-by-step-azul-fives-hotel-2015\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ves-hotel-2015\/<\/a><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andieyjerry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.172.196.170","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405611676,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279051.png?_r=1405694655","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":185,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andreaberretta","Id":279051,"Name":"andreaberretta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.178.143.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b5c143fa94e41d546bc9db4af2cc375","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello People,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All snaps are pretty. Let see this below&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/img0.etsystatic.com\/000\/1\/6374901\/il_fullxfull.284195996.jpg\" alt=\"il_fullxfull.284195996.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901154,"PostDate":1437819579,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello People,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All snaps are pretty. Let see this below<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/img0.etsystatic.com\/000\/1\/6374901\/il_fullxfull.284195996.jpg\" alt=\"il_fullxfull.284195996.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Chair Sashes, Chair Covers, Organza and Satin Bags Supplier in United States. Tulle Fabric and Ribbons.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.cawraps.com'>www.cawraps.com<\/a>","Email":"joliebrad20@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.178.98.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437733467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joliebrad20","Id":284110,"Name":"joliebrad20","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94c79c232bc5b381c29b7b3b1a5051c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;At Caletas we pretty much try to recreate the inspiration each bride has in mind: There are many flower options to find in M\u00e9xico and you can practically have any color, shape or size.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;That way we allow each bride to add her style to enhance our private beach location. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Some brides opt &amp;nbsp;for the beach wedding theme when choosing their &amp;nbsp;centerpices and another cute detail is adding candles wich makes it more romantic at night.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Here are some of the recent creations we&#039;ve had:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81807]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81806]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#61a5b9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;Adventure Weddings &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#61a5b9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AdventureWedding&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:1pt;\"&gt;VAD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/adventurew\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:1pt;\"&gt;VAD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21577-adventure-weddings-las-caletas\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901382,"PostDate":1438118965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">At Caletas we pretty much try to recreate the inspiration each bride has in mind: There are many flower options to find in M\u00e9xico and you can practically have any color, shape or size.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">That way we allow each bride to add her style to enhance our private beach location. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">Some brides opt \u00a0for the beach wedding theme when choosing their \u00a0centerpices and another cute detail is adding candles wich makes it more romantic at night.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">Here are some of the recent creations we've had:<\/span><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81807-flower-centerpieces\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_48176.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Flower Centerpieces'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Flower Centerpieces' id='sml_image_view_81807' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81806-centerpieces-all-sizes-and-shapes\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_150093.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Centerpieces all sizes and shapes'  width='200' height='190'  alt='Centerpieces all sizes and shapes' id='sml_image_view_81806' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#000000\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#61a5b9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\">Adventure Weddings <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a href='https:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#61a5b9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\">Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AdventureWedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:1pt\">VAD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/adventurew\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:1pt\">VAD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t