Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ce1c554383c1b943f22846cf93df376","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;jennifer8913&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\nThanks ladies!!!! I appreciate it!! I will bring the ribbons and let the coordinator decide if they will be used :)&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; Where did you find the lanterns? So cute! Great job! I agree - you may not need the ribbon - but either way it looks great :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1780176,"PostDate":1374182028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>jennifer8913<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><br>Thanks ladies!!!! I appreciate it!! I will bring the ribbons and let the coordinator decide if they will be used <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p> Where did you find the lanterns? So cute! Great job! I agree - you may not need the ribbon - but either way it looks great <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelsea_catanzarita@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"8.28.150.75","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1352919772,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262370.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":183,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChelseaCat802","Id":262370,"Name":"ChelseaCat802","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"248346f7d4b6d3286e5c9ab81220dffd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks!!!! I got the lanterns online~ here is the link &lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; Where did you find the lanterns? So cute! Great job! I agree - you may not need the ribbon - but either way it looks great :)&lt;\/blockquote&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1780266,"PostDate":1374198569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks!!!! I got the lanterns online~ here is the link <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> Where did you find the lanterns? So cute! Great job! I agree - you may not need the ribbon - but either way it looks great <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4944c1fb64427cf5dfcafd1c79012b42","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jennifer8913[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sorry, image didn&#039;t want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece! \n please give me your opinions![\/quote] \n \n Looks fabulous! I&#039;ve never seen lanterns like that before. Definitely lightweight and easy to bring down with you. Nice work!","Attachments":[],"Id":1780500,"PostDate":1374257166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jennifer8913<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry, image didn't want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece!<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374099431060_934\"> please give me your opinions!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Looks fabulous! I've never seen lanterns like that before. Definitely lightweight and easy to bring down with you. Nice work!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberly.j.schwartz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.149.174.159","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362612352,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266986.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ironman","Id":266986,"Name":"ironman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3a9f72fe1a20ec3d514bece4db0344d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tmdavis13[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We did not want to waste money on flowers and our beautiful beach setting needed little to be added. We used mirrors to reflect the light and surrounding candles. We also added Patron Silver bottles to each table, this brought in our green color and invited guests to take them with them to the after party (though some guests opened them at dinner! :)) And finally we used limes to number our tables. It was simple and didn&#039;t take up much room.  \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212709\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212710\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212711\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][\/quote] \n \n \n I love the tequila bottle!! What a great idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":1783282,"PostDate":1374796588,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tmdavis13<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We did not want to waste money on flowers and our beautiful beach setting needed little to be added. We used mirrors to reflect the light and surrounding candles. We also added Patron Silver bottles to each table, this brought in our green color and invited guests to take them with them to the after party (though some guests opened them at dinner! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>) And finally we used limes to number our tables. It was simple and didn't take up much room.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_1598\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212709\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212709\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_2566\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212710\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212710\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_9180\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212711\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212711\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> I love the tequila bottle!! What a great idea!<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kasey_98@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.215.47.213","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1335145077,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254373.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kasey04","Id":254373,"Name":"Kasey04","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ca63070bc68bbd37b386b77842bc9d1","RawContent":"thank you!! quote name=\"ironman\" url=\"\/t\/9012\/post-your-centerpieces-here\/1290#post_1928569\"] Looks fabulous! I&#039;ve never seen lanterns like that before. Definitely lightweight and easy to bring down with you. Nice work! [\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1783434,"PostDate":1374827907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thank you!! quote name=\"ironman\" url=\"\/t\/9012\/post-your-centerpieces-here\/1290#post_1928569\"] Looks fabulous! I've never seen lanterns like that before. Definitely lightweight and easy to bring down with you. Nice work! [\/quote]\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae75dd4ce7092c4836d8a04e2a1ceb9d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jennifer8913[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I need honest opinions!!! I leave in less than 3 weeks, and aside from seating chart this has been my second biggest headache!![\/quote] \n Those lanterns are great. I wish I had found them for my wedding because we were on the beach and the candles we had would not stay lit bc f the breeze. I got frustrated trying to make my centerpieces and just purchased them lol. But the lanterns I absolutely love. I kind of like the ribbons- maybe just one pink ribbon on the lamp and the middle and the other two lamps with no ribbons at all?","Attachments":[],"Id":1786541,"PostDate":1375462066,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jennifer8913<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I need honest opinions!!! I leave in less than 3 weeks, and aside from seating chart this has been my second biggest headache!!<\/blockquote> <p> Those lanterns are great. I wish I had found them for my wedding because we were on the beach and the candles we had would not stay lit bc f the breeze. I got frustrated trying to make my centerpieces and just purchased them lol. But the lanterns I absolutely love. I kind of like the ribbons- maybe just one pink ribbon on the lamp and the middle and the other two lamps with no ribbons at all?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343687362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b15f5f06b3e046f412be3fa6158e592e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]EVKnowsitall[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Those lanterns are great. I wish I had found them for my wedding because we were on the beach and the candles we had would not stay lit bc f the breeze. I got frustrated trying to make my centerpieces and just purchased them lol. But the lanterns I absolutely love. I kind of like the ribbons- maybe just one pink ribbon on the lamp and the middle and the other two lamps with no ribbons at all?[\/quote] \n Sorry- one ribbon on the middle lamp and no ribbons on the other two on the sides- sorry can&#039;t type today lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1786543,"PostDate":1375462105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>EVKnowsitall<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Those lanterns are great. I wish I had found them for my wedding because we were on the beach and the candles we had would not stay lit bc f the breeze. I got frustrated trying to make my centerpieces and just purchased them lol. But the lanterns I absolutely love. I kind of like the ribbons- maybe just one pink ribbon on the lamp and the middle and the other two lamps with no ribbons at all?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Sorry- one ribbon on the middle lamp and no ribbons on the other two on the sides- sorry can't type today lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343687362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d965e2ae8301ee8b80c50e6bf283eb51","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]EVKnowsitall[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sorry- one ribbon on the middle lamp and no ribbons on the other two on the sides- sorry can&#039;t type today lol[\/quote] \n \n Thanks!!! I knew what you meant!!!! Congratulations on your recent wedding!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1786549,"PostDate":1375463025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>EVKnowsitall<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry- one ribbon on the middle lamp and no ribbons on the other two on the sides- sorry can't type today lol<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Thanks!!! I knew what you meant!!!! Congratulations on your recent wedding!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c6c663d3454e0a4e140652fd895f0d7","RawContent":"Love all the ideas. I thought I had mine narrowed down to large ikea galvanized lanterns, however they were recently discontinued. Now I need to come up with a plan B.","Attachments":[],"Id":1801982,"PostDate":1379909706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love all the ideas. I thought I had mine narrowed down to large ikea galvanized lanterns, however they were recently discontinued. Now I need to come up with a plan B.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Tara.basgall@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362241743,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266797.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tbasgall","Id":266797,"Name":"Tbasgall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5fead944d2e12edc583a2c65b5588ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love these ideas, keep &#039;em coming.&amp;nbsp; Hopefully I&#039;ll have my centrepieces ready soon so I can post some pictures.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1804153,"PostDate":1380634695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love these ideas, keep 'em coming.\u00a0 Hopefully I'll have my centrepieces ready soon so I can post some pictures.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m8chow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.227.202","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362617328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":175,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"m8chow","Id":266988,"Name":"m8chow","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1355,"TotalPages":136,"CurrentPage":1310,"NextPage":1320,"PreviousPage":1300,"LastPage":1350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key"