> User Natasha28 (286090)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de4a2b81806cb42c99465a97207fd806","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tmdavis13[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We did not want to waste money on flowers and our beautiful beach setting needed little to be added. We used mirrors to reflect the light and surrounding candles. We also added Patron Silver bottles to each table, this brought in our green color and invited guests to take them with them to the after party (though some guests opened them at dinner! :)) And finally we used limes to number our tables. It was simple and didn&#039;t take up much room.  \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212709\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212710\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212711\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][\/quote] \n \n That is a GREAT idea!!!!!  I love it!!!!!!!!!  Did you buy the liquor once you got to Mexico?  Did your hotel charge you anything for using that as your centerpiece?   Thank you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1779254,"PostDate":1374011035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tmdavis13<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We did not want to waste money on flowers and our beautiful beach setting needed little to be added. We used mirrors to reflect the light and surrounding candles. We also added Patron Silver bottles to each table, this brought in our green color and invited guests to take them with them to the after party (though some guests opened them at dinner! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>) And finally we used limes to number our tables. It was simple and didn't take up much room.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_1598\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212709\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212709\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_2566\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212710\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212710\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_9180\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212711\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212711\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> That is a GREAT idea!!!!!\u00a0 I love it!!!!!!!!!\u00a0 Did you buy the liquor once you got to Mexico?\u00a0 Did your hotel charge you anything for using that as your centerpiece?\u00a0\u00a0 Thank you!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"un4gitabl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.173.185.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351884072,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262012.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"un4gitabl","Id":262012,"Name":"un4gitabl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2da5415dcbe82de1188a4f88bbdb6e2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks un4gitabl! We went with the don&#039;t ask hope they don&#039;t care policy, and no-one minded. We had already paid for open bar so no one seemed to care. In fact, when they cleared the tables the bar held the bottles for us that no-one had grabbed. We purchased the bottles at duty free in the airport, there is a per person limit so we asked a few guest to pick one bottle each up for us, they were so happy when they saw them at dinner! As a few trusted friends and buy extra in case someone forgets, we managed to drink the extra!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779260,"PostDate":1374011434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks un4gitabl! We went with the don't ask hope they don't care policy, and no-one minded. We had already paid for open bar so no one seemed to care. In fact, when they cleared the tables the bar held the bottles for us that no-one had grabbed. We purchased the bottles at duty free in the airport, there is a per person limit so we asked a few guest to pick one bottle each up for us, they were so happy when they saw them at dinner! As a few trusted friends and buy extra in case someone forgets, we managed to drink the extra!<\/p>  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyler.mae.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333851659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253725.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tmdavis13","Id":253725,"Name":"tmdavis13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"737eb04fe2340b64063117275cb83923","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That is probably what we would do, hope they don&#039;t but deal with it at that time if they do :-)&amp;nbsp; Thank you again for posting!&amp;nbsp; I really think we may do this!!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779277,"PostDate":1374014816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That is probably what we would do, hope they don't but deal with it at that time if they do :-)\u00a0 Thank you again for posting!\u00a0 I really think we may do this!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"un4gitabl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.173.185.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351884072,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262012.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"un4gitabl","Id":262012,"Name":"un4gitabl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e47b29eaa1c9dc6a6780686dcd41162","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; P.S. do you happen to remember the duty free limit?&amp;nbsp; I can look it up, but I thought I would ask :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779278,"PostDate":1374014852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> P.S. do you happen to remember the duty free limit?\u00a0 I can look it up, but I thought I would ask :-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"un4gitabl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.173.185.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351884072,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262012.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"un4gitabl","Id":262012,"Name":"un4gitabl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9be269132d01d3f5c737887b38b88162","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t, sorry. I think it&#039;s three bottles per person but that may be wrong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779663,"PostDate":1374092307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I don't, sorry. I think it's three bottles per person but that may be wrong.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyler.mae.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333851659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253725.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tmdavis13","Id":253725,"Name":"tmdavis13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b756d8ce8995591505150f52315512a","RawContent":"I need honest opinions!!! I leave in less than 3 weeks, and aside from seating chart this has been my second biggest headache!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1779774,"PostDate":1374102663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I need honest opinions!!! I leave in less than 3 weeks, and aside from seating chart this has been my second biggest headache!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d452c5b6a5ee5bc2bd82a37fcca7d29","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sorry, image didn&#039;t want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374099431060_934\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"212903\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;please give me your opinions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779777,"PostDate":1374103114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sorry, image didn't want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece!<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374099431060_934\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"212903\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>please give me your opinions!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3447285a973b087d81937c9e9defc7d2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jennifer8913\"]\nSorry, image didn&#039;t want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece! [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"212903\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 621px\"&gt; [\/url]please give me your opinions![\/quote] I love it...it&#039;s beachy, simple and elegant, plus I love pink and white, those are my colors!","Attachments":[],"Id":1779783,"PostDate":1374105128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"jennifer8913\" url=\"\/t\/9012\/post&#045;your&#045;centerpieces&#045;here\/1290#post_1927846\"><p>Sorry, image didn't want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece! <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"212903\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 621px\"><\/span> <\/a>please give me your opinions!<\/p><\/blockquote> I love it...it's beachy, simple and elegant, plus I love pink and white, those are my colors!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hclibby1982@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.6.207.201","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1368623569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269603.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":115,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hclibby1982","Id":269603,"Name":"hclibby1982","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d074b0cb7b1e6ce5ef6bbd1a7f0728a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jennifer8913[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sorry, image didn&#039;t want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece! \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]please give me your opinions![\/quote] \n I think this looks great! very classic! My only thought is you don&#039;t need the ribbons on the lanterns...if you are going to illuminate them I think it will look great with them plain!...this will make the pink on the table stand out more too! or maybe lower them...I don&#039;t know. Just my random thinking. You did awesome! Hooray for your wedding in 3 weeks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1779789,"PostDate":1374106151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jennifer8913<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry, image didn't want to upload on my phone, here is my hopefully centerpiece!<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1374099431060_934\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212903\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212903\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>please give me your opinions!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I think this looks great! very classic! My only thought is you don't need the ribbons on the lanterns...if you are going to illuminate them I think it will look great with them plain!...this will make the pink on the table stand out more too! or maybe lower them...I don't know. Just my random thinking. You did awesome! Hooray for your wedding in 3 weeks!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksingleton2512@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364243401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267777.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimsing12","Id":267777,"Name":"kimsing12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09f0d28bbdf7f243729327db2c8e1257","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kimsing12[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I think this looks great! very classic! My only thought is you don&#039;t need the ribbons on the lanterns...if you are going to illuminate them I think it will look great with them plain!...this will make the pink on the table stand out more too! or maybe lower them...I don&#039;t know. Just my random thinking. You did awesome! Hooray for your wedding in 3 weeks![\/quote] \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]hclibby1982[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I love it...it&#039;s beachy, simple and elegant, plus I love pink and white, those are my colors![\/quote] \n \n Thanks ladies!!!! I appreciate it!! I will bring the ribbons and let the coordinator decide if they will be used :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1780165,"PostDate":1374181227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kimsing12<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I think this looks great! very classic! My only thought is you don't need the ribbons on the lanterns...if you are going to illuminate them I think it will look great with them plain!...this will make the pink on the table stand out more too! or maybe lower them...I don't know. Just my random thinking. You did awesome! Hooray for your wedding in 3 weeks!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>hclibby1982<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I love it...it's beachy, simple and elegant, plus I love pink and white, those are my colors!<\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Thanks ladies!!!! I appreciate it!! I will bring the ribbons and let the coordinator decide if they will be used <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1355,"TotalPages":136,"CurrentPage":1300,"NextPage":1310,"PreviousPage":1290,"LastPage":1350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
