{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"215efe63da0e682d1ad313b8ff1307bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m still super torn on centerpieces!&amp;nbsp; I want as little as possible to carry with me, but I have to have a table number.&amp;nbsp; I was thinking a vellum wrapped around an electric candle may be a great option for table numbers because then it will still fold flat.   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1772694,"PostDate":1372275266,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm still super torn on centerpieces!\u00a0 I want as little as possible to carry with me, but I have to have a table number.\u00a0 I was thinking a vellum wrapped around an electric candle may be a great option for table numbers because then it will still fold flat. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"un4gitabl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.173.185.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351884072,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262012.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"un4gitabl","Id":262012,"Name":"un4gitabl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19797a34a87c6a38c800f95fffc4edc7","RawContent":"We went with wooden numbers that I painted with our wedding colors for a table number - it was easy, clear, and cheap! Our photographers got some pictures, they&#039;re listed in the below link uner the &#039;reception&#039; folder. http:\/\/proofs.gntphoto.com\/enterEvent.php?id=836944&amp;returnURL=\/collection.php?event=836944 password: Kocelko","Attachments":[],"Id":1772724,"PostDate":1372279343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We went with wooden numbers that I painted with our wedding colors for a table number - it was easy, clear, and cheap! Our photographers got some pictures, they're listed in the below link uner the 'reception' folder. <a href='http:\/\/proofs.gntphoto.com\/enterEvent.php?id=836944&returnURL=\/collection.php?event=836944' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/proofs.gntpho...hp?event=836944<\/a> password: Kocelko\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samandlindseywedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.223.0.163","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1350398460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261421.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LKocelko","Id":261421,"Name":"LKocelko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b29d92aac175a8d6be2fe06639bb0e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Very pretty! Did you bring the vases yourself, or did you rent from resort?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1772735,"PostDate":1372280240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Very pretty! Did you bring the vases yourself, or did you rent from resort?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"253caee7accbbcb15ae2d2a888892fed","RawContent":"We brought them, because we only had 3 tabels. Renting was so absurdly overpriced, and my MOH had them leftover from her wedding. So we brought down all of our decor, just checked an extra bag.","Attachments":[],"Id":1772766,"PostDate":1372283330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We brought them, because we only had 3 tabels. Renting was so absurdly overpriced, and my MOH had them leftover from her wedding. So we brought down all of our decor, just checked an extra bag.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samandlindseywedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.223.0.163","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1350398460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261421.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LKocelko","Id":261421,"Name":"LKocelko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50a6c6de2b1c15312a8d0d2b0663c79f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LKocelko[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n We brought them, because we only had 3 tabels. Renting was so absurdly overpriced, and my MOH had them leftover from her wedding. So we brought down all of our decor, just checked an extra bag.[\/quote] \n ok great!! thats exactly what we are planning to do!! their fees are ridiculous! how did you pack them so the wouldn&#039;t break? Bubble wrap? and did you stuff clothes inside the vases? I&#039;m just panicked that I will get all the way down there and things be broken :(  thanks for your help!","Attachments":[],"Id":1773028,"PostDate":1372352114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LKocelko<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> We brought them, because we only had 3 tabels. Renting was so absurdly overpriced, and my MOH had them leftover from her wedding. So we brought down all of our decor, just checked an extra bag.<\/blockquote> <p> ok great!! thats exactly what we are planning to do!! their fees are ridiculous! how did you pack them so the wouldn't break? Bubble wrap? and did you stuff clothes inside the vases? I'm just panicked that I will get all the way down there and things be broken <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\u00a0 thanks for your help!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"993282b1d974d0d5808995a89eff682f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jennifer8913[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n ok great!! thats exactly what we are planning to do!! their fees are ridiculous! how did you pack them so the wouldn&#039;t break? Bubble wrap? and did you stuff clothes inside the vases? I&#039;m just panicked that I will get all the way down there and things be broken :(  thanks for your help![\/quote] \n \n Yup, stuffed clothes in them! And then wrapped them in lots of clothes\/our sashes and table runners. We were trying to make the most out of our luggage space. Everything made it down in one piece. Go figure the day after the wedding my husband accidentally knocks one and breaks it :P","Attachments":[],"Id":1773210,"PostDate":1372372436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jennifer8913<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> ok great!! thats exactly what we are planning to do!! their fees are ridiculous! how did you pack them so the wouldn't break? Bubble wrap? and did you stuff clothes inside the vases? I'm just panicked that I will get all the way down there and things be broken <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\u00a0 thanks for your help!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Yup, stuffed clothes in them! And then wrapped them in lots of clothes\/our sashes and table runners. We were trying to make the most out of our luggage space. Everything made it down in one piece. Go figure the day after the wedding my husband accidentally knocks one and breaks it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samandlindseywedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.223.0.163","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1350398460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261421.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LKocelko","Id":261421,"Name":"LKocelko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"811ca06ede22fa3f32d448879a07bc2c","RawContent":"Lo[quote name=\"Backy\"]\ni like this one!! pretty[\/quote]ve this. It&#039;s exactly what I want to do!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1773251,"PostDate":1372381440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lo<blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Backy\" url=\"\/t\/9012\/post&#045;your&#045;centerpieces&#045;here\/1260#post_1917367\"><p>i like this one!! pretty<\/p><\/blockquote>ve this. It's exactly what I want to do!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"be.t.phan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.128.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367901015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269347.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nov2013maya","Id":269347,"Name":"nov2013maya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79c9687fd1b47dda64b19cf465538080","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LKocelko[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Yup, stuffed clothes in them! And then wrapped them in lots of clothes\/our sashes and table runners. We were trying to make the most out of our luggage space. Everything made it down in one piece. Go figure the day after the wedding my husband accidentally knocks one and breaks it :P[\/quote] \n \n LOL awww, well as long as it was after!!! Thanks so much for your advice, I am starting to pack everything now and I am starting with all the decor [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1773378,"PostDate":1372432350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LKocelko<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Yup, stuffed clothes in them! And then wrapped them in lots of clothes\/our sashes and table runners. We were trying to make the most out of our luggage space. Everything made it down in one piece. Go figure the day after the wedding my husband accidentally knocks one and breaks it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> LOL awww, well as long as it was after!!! Thanks so much for your advice, I am starting to pack everything now and I am starting with all the decor <span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1372428643524_1346\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1372428643524_1345\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341025705,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c71ff7cac61470ba04775650565ef3ab","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]juliboley[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Our wedding had a Mexican theme, so we used coffee cans (easy to pack because we packed our OOT bag stuff inside of them) and then our WC took the flowers from our Huppah and put them into the cans to make the centerpieces for our reception.  The talavera tiles were coasters that we made as our wedding favors with our wedding date and names on the back (not as easy to pack because they are heavy): \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/182226\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/182227\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote] \n I am in LOVE with these!! I think i found the last piece to my centerpieces! This is SO helpful!","Attachments":[],"Id":1779024,"PostDate":1373985687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>juliboley<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Our wedding had a Mexican theme, so we used coffee cans (easy to pack because we packed our OOT bag stuff inside of them) and then our WC took the flowers from our Huppah and put them into the cans to make the centerpieces for our reception. \u00a0The talavera tiles were coasters that we made as our wedding favors with our wedding date and names on the back (not as easy to pack because they are heavy):<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1358555757925_1653\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"182226\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/182226\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1358555757925_2235\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"182227\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/182227\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I am in LOVE with these!! I think i found the last piece to my centerpieces! This is SO helpful!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksingleton2512@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364243401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267777.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimsing12","Id":267777,"Name":"kimsing12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d76db9eaac265874a537e8d1f9d27151","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We did not want to waste money on flowers and our beautiful beach setting needed little to be added. We used mirrors to reflect the light and surrounding candles. We also added Patron Silver bottles to each table, this brought in our green color and invited guests to take them with them to the after party (though some guests opened them at dinner! :)) And finally we used limes to number our tables. It was simple and didn&#039;t take up much room.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_1598\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"212709\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212709\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_2566\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"212710\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212710\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_9180\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"212711\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212711\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1779123,"PostDate":1373998457,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We did not want to waste money on flowers and our beautiful beach setting needed little to be added. We used mirrors to reflect the light and surrounding candles. We also added Patron Silver bottles to each table, this brought in our green color and invited guests to take them with them to the after party (though some guests opened them at dinner! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>) And finally we used limes to number our tables. It was simple and didn't take up much room.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_1598\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212709\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212709\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_2566\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212710\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212710\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1373994502862_9180\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"212711\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/212711\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tyler.mae.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333851659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253725.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tmdavis13","Id":253725,"Name":"tmdavis13","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1355,"TotalPages":136,"CurrentPage":1290,"NextPage":1300,"PreviousPage":1280,"LastPage":1350},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
