{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfc4f311502085fbb57e0a0ddb738aa6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]shan0487[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Ok ladies- here are my close-ups.  I used 15 strands of raffia and used a folding chair to estimate the desired length.  I had 3 colors so I made 5 strands of each color per decoration.  You can see how I hot glued the cardstock to the back of the starfish for support. Also, the raffia curls much more than this, but again- mine was packed to and from Mexico- so they straighten out a little via travel.   Let me know if you have any other questions! :)  \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192411\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192412\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192413\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192414\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n And they really aren&#039;t that hard to make- I think two of us made 6 of them in about an hour and a half and we were girl talking the whole time- so you know how that slows things down! :)[\/quote] \n \n Great job! I think I&#039;m going to try making these too...they look awesome!","Attachments":[],"Id":1763832,"PostDate":1370277760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>shan0487<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Ok ladies- here are my close-ups. \u00a0I used 15 strands of raffia and used a folding chair to estimate the desired length. \u00a0I had 3 colors so I made 5 strands of each color per decoration. \u00a0You can see how I hot glued the cardstock to the back of the starfish for support. Also, the raffia curls much more than this, but again- mine was packed to and from Mexico- so they straighten out a little via travel. \u00a0 Let me know if you have any other questions! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362612635314_1560\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"192411\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192411\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362612635314_2398\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"192412\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192412\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362612635314_3366\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"192413\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192413\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362612635314_4260\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"192414\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/192414\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And they really aren't that hard to make- I think two of us made 6 of them in about an hour and a half and we were girl talking the whole time- so you know how that slows things down! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Great job! I think I'm going to try making these too...they look awesome!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"","IpAddress":"","GroupId":0,"GroupName":"","JoinDate":0,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Guest_1derwomanbride_*","Id":0,"Name":"Guest_1derwomanbride_*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50c47dcb1588930d9db19a95a41cffd0","RawContent":"Thanks! \n \n They aren&#039;t very hard to make- just a little time consuming since there are a few steps to them! :)  PM me if you have any questions! :) \n \n Shanna [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]1derwomanbride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Great job! I think I&#039;m going to try making these too...they look awesome![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1763834,"PostDate":1370278001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> They aren't very hard to make- just a little time consuming since there are a few steps to them! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 PM me if you have any questions! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Shanna<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>1derwomanbride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Great job! I think I'm going to try making these too...they look awesome!<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294263874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be6b1b3aa7986cb8503edc158da35625","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; how did you do this?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1769113,"PostDate":1371431801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n  