; [\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197312\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"197312\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"234\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197312\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197312\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 234px;\" width=\"350\"&gt; [\/url][\/quote]Soooo pretty... Wondering of I can find static bowls n if its look too cheap! This is soo beautiful!!! I love the seashells!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1769188,"PostDate":1371442367,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Mufin1785\" url=\"\/t\/9012\/post&#045;your&#045;centerpieces&#045;here\/1230#post_1891974\"><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197313\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"197313\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"525\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197313\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 525px;\" width=\"350\"><\/span> <\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197312\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"197312\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"234\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/197312\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 234px;\" width=\"350\"><\/span> <\/a><\/p><\/blockquote>Soooo pretty... Wondering of I can find static bowls n if its look too cheap! This is soo beautiful!!! I love the seashells!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"liannscuadroni@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1336159315,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254940.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Liann03","Id":254940,"Name":"Liann03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd13379ce7b12d0369fb84ae4c39c873","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Liann03[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Soooo pretty... Wondering of I can find static bowls n if its look too cheap! This is soo beautiful!!! I love the seashells!![\/quote] \n I got these fish bowls at the dollar store for $1, but these are glass.  I guess you are worried about traveling with glass.  Good Luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1769290,"PostDate":1371480438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Liann03<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Soooo pretty... Wondering of I can find static bowls n if its look too cheap! This is soo beautiful!!! I love the seashells!!<\/blockquote> <p> I got these fish bowls at the dollar store for $1, but these are glass.\u00a0 I guess you are worried about traveling with glass.\u00a0 Good Luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolyn.webre@selu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295377193,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235700.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mufin1785","Id":235700,"Name":"Mufin1785","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":6277,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a03b0c3fe15bf8438304aab9ec196a92","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MoonPalacePookie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n These are the pictures I&#039;m using as inspiration for my centerpieces:\n [img]http:\/\/i296.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm170\/bunnyhunny24\/8247c.jpg[\/img]\n \n [img]http:\/\/i296.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm170\/bunnyhunny24\/large_image.jpg[\/img]\n \n [img]http:\/\/i296.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm170\/bunnyhunny24\/large_imageCAAPY948.jpg[\/img]\n \n I found some beautiful fake green orchids at Michael&#039;s and they&#039;re 50% off. We&#039;ll bring those, rocks and candles. I still need to talk to my WC about renting vases, I really dont want to bring them with me. I&#039;ll do a bunch of tealights around the vases on each table.\n \n And YAY for me for figuring out how to do this whole picture posting thing. :)[\/quote] \n \n i like this one!! pretty","Attachments":[],"Id":1769298,"PostDate":1371482103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MoonPalacePookie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> These are the pictures I'm using as inspiration for my centerpieces:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i296.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm170\/bunnyhunny24\/8247c.jpg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i296.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm170\/bunnyhunny24\/large_image.jpg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i296.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm170\/bunnyhunny24\/large_imageCAAPY948.jpg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I found some beautiful fake green orchids at Michael's and they're 50% off. We'll bring those, rocks and candles. I still need to talk to my WC about renting vases, I really dont want to bring them with me. I'll do a bunch of tealights around the vases on each table.<br \/> <br \/> And YAY for me for figuring out how to do this whole picture posting thing. <img sr