{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.134.72.6","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1431618438,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a8da3cba646a10fad239be18e04f67c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello beautiful brides,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know that brainstorming for the OOT bag can be frustrating and also challenging, so many ideas and counting how many days are left to the wedding day can be a nerve wreck!! :o&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you order too soon&lt;\/strong&gt;: you &amp;nbsp;might change your mind, specially if you find something nicer and better later where you might be regretting because you spent money already and changed your mind (this is the most common situation while planning)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you order too late and wait for ideas&lt;\/strong&gt;: you might miss good sales, deliveries, colors, items available etc..&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;OOT Bags and Favors:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; I feel that this will depend on what you want to spend and how crazy you want to go (with the details). There is not right or wrong to spend too much or too little, because each bride doing either or will have her own justification..which is understandable!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What was important to me for the OOT bags-favors:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The colors, logos and the designs matching my entire wedding theme were my big dream!&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;,&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;I was doing tons of research. I starting placing several orders online and spent good money in the begging. When my orders started arriving I realized that I did not have a wedding theme or any logo with colors that matched anywhere . I was very concern and the orders were disappointing because I had spent good money already. I wanted to have my own logo,same designs, colors and my wedding theme displayed EVERYWHERE, , basically ALL matching.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;My colors were coral and aqua. All on my wedding day came beautifully and exactly how I dreamed it and my OOT bags were just what I planned on every single design.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;I am good at designing and I love to create ideas for decor and all that fun stuff :wub:&amp;nbsp;, since I have a brother who is very skilled, I asked him to sit down with me and start creating a \"Lina &amp;amp; TK\" wedding theme...it would be our design displayed EVERYWHERE. brainstorm on what I envisioned. We used our suite design program (reason why I do not have templates :( ) PLEASE!! ask any questions you may want...I would LOVE to create an entire wedding theme for a bride :)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;I do finance LOL and discovered how much I love this&amp;nbsp; :wub:&amp;nbsp;this is just pretty far from what I do for a living! ;)&amp;nbsp;more than happy to help! it is exciting!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Yes!! we got tons of ideas from this website which I am very thankful for. all pics below are DIY and MORE ...&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;The real hard work started to make my dream come true...welcome bags and some pics of decor too&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Now all designs come true:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; Bubbles for the ceremony&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; fans with programs (all customized with logos)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; Spanish and English (Had to do it in both languages)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; all would match my decor&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; I made these rings&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; inside the survival kit&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt; signage&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;FINALLY ALL MATCHED ON THE MOST AMAZING DAY OF MY LIFE!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;PS. Please open each picture attachment-thumbnail if you decide to view it BIGGER!! they appear small because I have attached so many lol&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;ALSO if you want to review my entire planning thread PLEASE check it out :) it might help you with some ideas!!!&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; ;)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Love,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lina&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895909,"PostDate":1431354420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello beautiful brides,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know that brainstorming for the OOT bag can be frustrating and also challenging, so many ideas and counting how many days are left to the wedding day can be a nerve wreck!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>If you order too soon<\/strong>: you \u00a0might change your mind, specially if you find something nicer and better later where you might be regretting because you spent money already and changed your mind (this is the most common situation while planning)<\/li>\n<li><strong>If you order too late and wait for ideas<\/strong>: you might miss good sales, deliveries, colors, items available etc..<\/li>\n<\/ul><p><strong><u>OOT Bags and Favors:<\/u><\/strong> I feel that this will depend on what you want to spend and how crazy you want to go (with the details). There is not right or wrong to spend too much or too little, because each bride doing either or will have her own justification..which is understandable!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>What was important to me for the OOT bags-favors:<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"color:#0000ff\"><strong>The colors, logos and the designs matching my entire wedding theme were my big dream!<\/strong><\/span>,<\/li>\n<li>I was doing tons of research. I starting placing several orders online and spent good money in the begging. When my orders started arriving I realized that I did not have a wedding theme or any logo with colors that matched anywhere . I was very concern and the orders were disappointing because I had spent good money already. I wanted to have my own logo,same designs, colors and my wedding theme displayed EVERYWHERE, , basically ALL matching.<\/li>\n<li>My colors were coral and aqua. All on my wedding day came beautifully and exactly how I dreamed it and my OOT bags were just what I planned on every single design.<\/li>\n<li>I am good at designing and I love to create ideas for decor and all that fun stuff <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0, since I have a brother who is very skilled, I asked him to sit down with me and start creating a \"Lina & TK\" wedding theme...it would be our design displayed EVERYWHERE. brainstorm on what I envisioned. We used our suite design program (reason why I do not have templates <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> ) PLEASE!! ask any questions you may want...I would LOVE to create an entire wedding theme for a bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/li>\n<li>I do finance LOL and discovered how much I love this\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0this is just pretty far from what I do for a living! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\u00a0more than happy to help! it is exciting!<\/li>\n<li>\u00a0Yes!! we got tons of ideas from this website which I am very thankful for. all pics below are DIY and MORE ...<\/li>\n<li>The real hard work started to make my dream come true...welcome bags and some pics of decor too<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>[attachment=32183:Logo (2).pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32184:ChApstick.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32185:Antibacterial.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32186:Logo CUPS.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32187:Round cups ready to print.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32188:Final Colors on welcome bags.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32189:PostCard Front.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32192:PostCard Back (1).pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32190:VIP front.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32191:VIP back.pdf]<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Now all designs come true:<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32194:WP_20150318_004.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32195:WP_20150318_003.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32196:WP_20150318_011.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32197:WP_20150318_019.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32198:WP_20150305_001.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32199:WP_20150305_002.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32201:137.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32202:490.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32203:330.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32204:491.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32205:492.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32206:493.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32207:494.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32208:496.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32208:496.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32209:500.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32210:749.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32211:keytips.jpg]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32212:cardeck.jpg]\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32213:bubbles1.jpg] Bubbles for the ceremony<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32214:422.JPG] fans with programs (all customized with logos)<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32215:425.JPG] Spanish and English (Had to do it in both languages)<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32216:020.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32217:755.JPG] all would match my decor<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32218:007.JPG] I made these rings<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32219:021.JPG] inside the survival kit<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32220:286.JPG] signage<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32221:table names and table number.JPG]<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>[attachment=32222:unnamed (7).jpg]FINALLY ALL MATCHED ON THE MOST AMAZING DAY OF MY LIFE!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul><li>PS. Please open each picture attachment-thumbnail if you decide to view it BIGGER!! they appear small because I have attached so many lol<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul><li>ALSO if you want to review my entire planning thread PLEASE check it out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> it might help you with some ideas!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lina\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396885157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1444491199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.220.24.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"968b970d4a3791ecb58b8507f953ea53","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow you did an amazing job! I LOVVVEEEEE the postcard idea but I have to know did people actually send them back? This is the first I have seen this idea and I think it&#039;s awesome! Wondering if it&#039;s worth the time to put on my ever growing to do list :) Plus I have postcard stamps left from out STDs&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Also, are you looking to sell the Muchas Gracias sign?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895969,"PostDate":1431404857,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow you did an amazing job! I LOVVVEEEEE the postcard idea but I have to know did people actually send them back? This is the first I have seen this idea and I think it's awesome! Wondering if it's worth the time to put on my ever growing to do list <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Plus I have postcard stamps left from out STDs<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Also, are you looking to sell the Muchas Gracias sign?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400521542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278025.jpg?_r=1438635345","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77d048f1956b2da6ac768dee0f6d1d26","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jsparrow10\" post=\"1895969\" timestamp=\"1431401257\"]\nWow you did an amazing job! I LOVVVEEEEE the postcard idea but I have to know did people actually send them back? This is the first I have seen this idea and I think it&#039;s awesome! Wondering if it&#039;s worth the time to put on my ever growing to do list :) Plus I have postcard stamps left from out STDs\n\nAlso, are you looking to sell the Muchas Gracias sign?[\/quote]Awhile back there was another bride who did it and got next to none back at time she mentioned it... Will be curious how Lina&#039;s experience is :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895971,"PostDate":1431405138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jsparrow10, on 11 May 2015 - 08:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Wow you did an amazing job! I LOVVVEEEEE the postcard idea but I have to know did people actually send them back? This is the first I have seen this idea and I think it's awesome! Wondering if it's worth the time to put on my ever growing to do list <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Plus I have postcard stamps left from out STDs<br><br>\nAlso, are you looking to sell the Muchas Gracias sign?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nAwhile back there was another bride who did it and got next to none back at time she mentioned it... Will be curious how Lina's experience is <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.220.24.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8774b890229e381e079c29ed371f7891","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] that&#039;s what I was expecting, was still hoping to be surprised! I mean it was like pulling teeth to get RSVPs back so I can imagine many wouldn&#039;t do it even though it&#039;s a great idea!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895974,"PostDate":1431406147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> that's what I was expecting, was still hoping to be surprised! I mean it was like pulling teeth to get RSVPs back so I can imagine many wouldn't do it even though it's a great idea!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400521542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278025.jpg?_r=1438635345","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36634e70ab9f7e2890c9b1803f473de3","RawContent":"I had people not even sign my guestbook when I had it announced 3 times lol!!! I sent some to my family to sign and never got those back either! Ha! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1895975,"PostDate":1431406956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had people not even sign my guestbook when I had it announced 3 times lol!!! I sent some to my family to sign and never got those back either! Ha! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.116.100.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5da2e29f44501cf82bb5659be1c11a79","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The wedding was one month and 2 days ago. I have NOT received anything back LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jsparrow10\"] Yes I got the sign :) where do you live?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895983,"PostDate":1431433606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The wedding was one month and 2 days ago. I have NOT received anything back LOL<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278025\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278025-jsparrow10\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jsparrow10<\/span><\/a> Yes I got the sign <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> where do you live?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396885157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1444491199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97b54007bfc947a65e219291522faeeb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great job! Everything has so much attention to detail and it all came together so perfectly! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895987,"PostDate":1431438236,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great job! Everything has so much attention to detail and it all came together so perfectly! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.220.24.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e004725ed7eb5a55f7085030163a5364","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"linaco80\"] Bummer! Maybe they&#039;re still recovering and having a hard time picking their favorite moment ;) I am located in Ohio!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896020,"PostDate":1431457228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277499-linaco80\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">linaco80<\/span><\/a> Bummer! Maybe they're still recovering and having a hard time picking their favorite moment <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> I am located in Ohio!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400521542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278025.jpg?_r=1438635345","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79173,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84ab00e85d6092643c7c22eae665935b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! Everything looks great! It seems that you pay so much attention to detail. I am the same way! LOL! The napkins that you have, what did you wrap them with? Is that construction paper or tissue paper? I think I want to do something similar but not for our OOT bags but for the ceremony. I want it to say \"if you shed a tear or two, here&#039;s a tissue just for you, so wipe away that happy tear, we are thankful that you are here\".&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896043,"PostDate":1431461644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! Everything looks great! It seems that you pay so much attention to detail. I am the same way! LOL! The napkins that you have, what did you wrap them with? Is that construction paper or tissue paper? I think I want to do something similar but not for our OOT bags but for the ceremony. I want it to say \"if you shed a tear or two, here's a tissue just for you, so wipe away that happy tear, we are thankful that you are here\".<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426176386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
