kes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"481ab8c12fb1b053b960d632b16e1ee2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"cometgirl\" post=\"1878633\" timestamp=\"1416296536\"]\nThank you so much for sharing the website where you found them. I have been searching high and low for dresses online and haven&#039;t had much luck![\/quote]No problem! Glad I could help. The site allows you to create a showroom also which I found super helpful. I chose my top favorites and the girls chose from there. I had ordered from the site for my SIL&#039;s wedding and had really good results. They offer their opinion before they put the order through in regards to sizing etc. Highly recommend.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879084,"PostDate":1416888084,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cometgirl, on 18 November 2014 - 12:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you so much for sharing the website where you found them. I have been searching high and low for dresses online and haven't had much luck!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>No problem! Glad I could help. The site allows you to create a showroom also which I found super helpful. I chose my top favorites and the girls chose from there. I had ordered from the site for my SIL's wedding and had really good results. They offer their opinion before they put the order through in regards to sizing etc. Highly recommend.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361741426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bcdcb82beeef8d8d610ffdbe4a46f6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m hoping it&#039;s not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":30094,"Name":"BM-purple.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-280004-0-14693800-1416925552.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-280004-0-14693800-1416925552_thumb.png","Width":407,"Height":567}],"Id":1879118,"PostDate":1416929180,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm hoping it's not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411664662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.91.171.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3776dc508b8612c71312e3f923538f8","RawContent":"This is really cute. My MOH wants to wear a long dress on the same day! LOL  Who makes this dress?\n[quote name=\"hellosassypants\" post=\"1879118\" timestamp=\"1416925580\"]\nI&#039;m hoping it&#039;s not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1879123,"PostDate":1416930627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is really cute. My MOH wants to wear a long dress on the same day! LOL\u00a0 Who makes this dress?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hellosassypants, on 25 November 2014 - 07:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm hoping it's not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409094707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19ac521aa9a4f647508ef936ed7d7aab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1879123\" timestamp=\"1416927027\"]\nThis is really cute. My MOH wants to wear a long dress on the same day! LOL  Who makes this dress?[\/quote]David&#039;s Bridal [url=\"http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/Product_strapless-crinkle-chiffon-dress-with-godets-f14865%C2%A0\"]http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/Product_strapless-crinkle-chiffon-dress-with-godets-f14865 [\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1879124,"PostDate":1416930840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 25 November 2014 - 07:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is really cute. My MOH wants to wear a long dress on the same day! LOL\u00a0 Who makes this dress?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>David's Bridal\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/Product_strapless-crinkle-chiffon-dress-with-godets-f14865%C2%A0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.davidsbri...-godets-f14865\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411664662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.25.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62cbcb54abe4bb0f6a62afbbb95b4a3c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hellosassypants\" post=\"1879118\" timestamp=\"1416925580\"]\nI&#039;m hoping it&#039;s not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.[\/quote]\nPretty! What was the approximate cost? We are getting married on a sky deck that can get quite windy so my girls are concerned with their dresses blowing up and would like to consider long dresses.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879130,"PostDate":1416938282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hellosassypants, on 25 November 2014 - 07:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm hoping it's not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nPretty! What was the approximate cost? We are getting married on a sky deck that can get quite windy so my girls are concerned with their dresses blowing up and would like to consider long dresses. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390260208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91bbc486429c1c425951fe797b20fed9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1879130\" timestamp=\"1416934682\"]\nPretty! What was the approximate cost? We are getting married on a sky deck that can get quite windy so my girls are concerned with their dresses blowing up and would like to consider long dresses.[\/quote]\nThank you! My bridesmaids were the ones who picked it out. It cost about $159.99 plus tax. My BMs said it was very soft when they tried on the dress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879136,"PostDate":1416939975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 25 November 2014 - 09:58 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Pretty! What was the approximate cost? We are getting married on a sky deck that can get quite windy so my girls are concerned with their dresses blowing up and would like to consider long dresses.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you! My bridesmaids were the ones who picked it out. It cost about $159.99 plus tax. My BMs said it was very soft when they tried on the dress.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411664662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.160.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1fe0a8dde99e9f973d32d74cace13f1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hellosassypants\" post=\"1879118\" timestamp=\"1416925580\"]\nI&#039;m hoping it&#039;s not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.[\/quote]I love the look of long dresses for bridesmaids but the fiance doesn&#039;t (he basically has to put up with mine because I told him that there was no way I&#039;d get a short dress for my wedding hahah). I guess short it is for the bridesmaids, and there&#039;s some really pretty ones out there. I just love the formal look of long dresses :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1879140,"PostDate":1416941312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hellosassypants, on 25 November 2014 - 07:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm hoping it's not too hot for my bridesmaid. I just really, really love the color.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love the look of long dresses for bridesmaids but the fiance doesn't (he basically has to put up with mine because I told him that there was no way I'd get a short dress for my wedding hahah). I guess short it is for the bridesmaids, and there's some really pretty ones out there. I just love the formal look of long dresses <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359766704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"111221f1883e079dd3b223d6a8dbd914","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Long dresses look so elegant even for a beach wedding....I found my girls dresses on the sale section of Donna Morgan&#039;s website and they worked out great. &amp;nbsp;Bought all 5 dresses for less than $300. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879153,"PostDate":1416952746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Long dresses look so elegant even for a beach wedding....I found my girls dresses on the sale section of Donna Morgan's website and they worked out great. \u00a0Bought all 5 dresses for less than $300. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1879153]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-264077-0-53075800-1416949024.jpg\" title=\"Sandy+David_W_0203.JPG -  140.6KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-264077-0-53075800-1416949024.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Sandy+David_W_0203.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1879153]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-264077-0-81361300-1416949090.jpg\" title=\"Sandy+David_W_0208.JPG -  139.15KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2014\/post-264077-0-81361300-1416949090.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Sandy+David_W_0208.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357678461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.157.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c5b35b97be603720b23e51b1516807f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My MOH ended up finding these dresses :&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.promgirl.com\/shop\/dresses\/viewitem-PD1261566&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.promgirl.com\/shop\/dresses\/viewitem-PD1261566&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They were $20 each! If they don&#039;t seem to look as good in person, oh well it was $20 and you have a nice summer dress now. I even ordered one for myself that of course I will not wear until after the wedding :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879158,"PostDate":1416959674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My MOH ended up finding these dresses :\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.promgirl.com\/shop\/dresses\/viewitem-PD1261566' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.promgirl....witem-PD1261566<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They were $20 each! If they don't seem to look as good in person, oh well it was $20 and you have a nice summer dress now. I even ordered one for myself that of course I will not wear until after the wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412134498,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":33,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
