{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79584,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bce16c1f18dcf0d4c37a6ef9f9ec8a6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hey! I am also a Karisma bride... getting married at El Dorado Royale in August of 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I considered the Azul properties (and loved them) but they decided to cut the kids off the list (there would have been 26 kids!!). I&#039;ve had such a great experience thus far working with the hotel. One thing I&#039;ve come to realize, is that it does take a few days for a response from the WC. But being this far out, it is understandable, and they have many weddings well before mine. maybe I&#039;m just very laid back.. But so far, no issues for me! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907343,"PostDate":1447173515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hey! I am also a Karisma bride... getting married at El Dorado Royale in August of 2016.<\/p>\n<p>I considered the Azul properties (and loved them) but they decided to cut the kids off the list (there would have been 26 kids!!). I've had such a great experience thus far working with the hotel. One thing I've come to realize, is that it does take a few days for a response from the WC. But being this far out, it is understandable, and they have many weddings well before mine. maybe I'm just very laid back.. But so far, no issues for me! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"embow345@aol.com","IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447171987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ekf6189","Id":285293,"Name":"ekf6189","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79584,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e18cde0d29e15c670a2bbedc5a7bfd67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n\t&lt;span&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284595-hirvine83\/\" title=\"\"&gt;hirvine83&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;-I know what you mean about trying to find the perfect location. We were looking into the Azul Five too but ended up going w\/ Azul Sensatori. I think because it was a little bigger and we have a lot of guest. We needed something that was very family friendly. I&#039;m so concerned about all the seaweed I keep reading about. Anyone else experience that when they went? I haven&#039;t seen it so I can&#039;t tell how bad it is. Hopefully it will be gone by next year!&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907653,"PostDate":1447770010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t<span>@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284595-hirvine83\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>hirvine83<\/a>\u00a0-I know what you mean about trying to find the perfect location. We were looking into the Azul Five too but ended up going w\/ Azul Sensatori. I think because it was a little bigger and we have a lot of guest. We needed something that was very family friendly. I'm so concerned about all the seaweed I keep reading about. Anyone else experience that when they went? I haven't seen it so I can't tell how bad it is. Hopefully it will be gone by next year!<\/span>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445608147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1458736489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.81.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79584,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d69cf7670ea014574eb8a296c59b3fa4","RawContent":"@[member=\"JRodz\"] My fianc\u00e9 and i stayed at Azul sensatori when we went for the brides dress rehearsal. I thought the resort was nice. Unfortunately, the seaweed was a major turn off for me. The resort workers were out there daily collecting seaweed but it was everywhere. I really hope they can get the seaweed issue under control before your wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1911897,"PostDate":1457998768,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285167-jrodz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JRodz<\/span><\/a> My fianc\u00e9 and i stayed at Azul sensatori when we went for the brides dress rehearsal. I thought the resort was nice. Unfortunately, the seaweed was a major turn off for me. The resort workers were out there daily collecting seaweed but it was everywhere. I really hope they can get the seaweed issue under control before your wedding. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasminr3803@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.143.196.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452598467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285860.jpeg?_r=1457570331","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jasminr3803","Id":285860,"Name":"Jasminr3803","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79584,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80acea8777629827fe065b8f240f233f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jasminr3803\"] Wow I&#039;m so happy I went w\/ my instincts and cancelled my contract with them. I had to start over but now I&#039;m super happy! Going to visit new location next weekend but have already decided on Hyatt Ziva Cancun! Where are you having yours?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912113,"PostDate":1458664932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285860\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285860-jasminr3803\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jasminr3803<\/span><\/a> Wow I'm so happy I went w\/ my instincts and cancelled my contract with them. I had to start over but now I'm super happy! Going to visit new location next weekend but have already decided on Hyatt Ziva Cancun! Where are you having yours?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445608147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1458736489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
