Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9252b84f6ef0d8d939304235171584df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"], are you going to go to a MAC in Mexico, or do it Canada and try to replicate?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868499,"PostDate":1408899890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a>, are you going to go to a MAC in Mexico, or do it Canada and try to replicate?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406740272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61654095de56116e4021f28937ddde5c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1868499\" timestamp=\"1408896290\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"], are you going to go to a MAC in Mexico, or do it Canada and try to replicate?[\/quote]\nMAC in Canada and try to replicate!!  keyword is TRY! \nPersonally, if we get step my step instructions I feel it shouldn&#039;t be too hard to replicate it.\nThere are a lot of women who do wonderful makeup on themselves, so I know I can be taught LOL!!!\n\nIf all else fails I can use their spa!","Attachments":[],"Id":1868500,"PostDate":1408900048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 24 August 2014 - 09:04 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a>, are you going to go to a MAC in Mexico, or do it Canada and try to replicate?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>MAC in Canada and try to replicate!! \u00a0keyword is TRY!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Personally, if we get step my step instructions I feel it shouldn't be too hard to replicate it.<\/p>\n<p>There are a lot of women who do wonderful makeup on themselves, so I know I can be taught LOL!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If all else fails I can use their spa!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8861a08dfde9c8f3339c78163ce71e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] If you&#039;re worried about flawless photo skin, I&#039;m sure worse comes to worse with editing from the photographer your skin will be amazing regardless! lol Even during my impromptu engagement photos my skin was flawless with nothing but my regular make up routine.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m planning on using the resort spa - hair and make-up day of wedding is part of my package. I was sent some photos of the work done and it seems to be pretty good. My fianc\u00e9 is also really big on me looking like \"me\". I plan to look like me but also don&#039;t want to look like I did nothing out of the norm to myself...I would like a touch of glamour! I think it&#039;s a great idea to go somewhere to get tips, I may do the same just in case. My moh is also pretty good at doing make up and will likely take care of the bridesmaids. Hoping the trial hair run will be good! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868558,"PostDate":1408922239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> If you're worried about flawless photo skin, I'm sure worse comes to worse with editing from the photographer your skin will be amazing regardless! lol Even during my impromptu engagement photos my skin was flawless with nothing but my regular make up routine.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm planning on using the resort spa - hair and make-up day of wedding is part of my package. I was sent some photos of the work done and it seems to be pretty good. My fianc\u00e9 is also really big on me looking like \"me\". I plan to look like me but also don't want to look like I did nothing out of the norm to myself...I would like a touch of glamour! I think it's a great idea to go somewhere to get tips, I may do the same just in case. My moh is also pretty good at doing make up and will likely take care of the bridesmaids. Hoping the trial hair run will be good! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406480117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3838c3a04b7795ccdd431fcd48b2fe3c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lia33\" post=\"1868558\" timestamp=\"1408918639\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] If you&#039;re worried about flawless photo skin, I&#039;m sure worse comes to worse with editing from the photographer your skin will be amazing regardless! lol Even during my impromptu engagement photos my skin was flawless with nothing but my regular make up routine. \n\nI&#039;m planning on using the resort spa - hair and make-up day of wedding is part of my package. I was sent some photos of the work done and it seems to be pretty good. My fianc\u00e9 is also really big on me looking like \"me\". I plan to look like me but also don&#039;t want to look like I did nothing out of the norm to myself...I would like a touch of glamour! I think it&#039;s a great idea to go somewhere to get tips, I may do the same just in case. My moh is also pretty good at doing make up and will likely take care of the bridesmaids. Hoping the trial hair run will be good![\/quote]\nI have sun spots which I am sure are going to be front and centre in that heat!!  So a good foundation will be high on my list.  If I can achieve the look thru someone showing me at MAC then I am all for that.  I want to look myself too, but I also want a bit more than my normal routine (ie I NEVER wear lipstick but will for my wedding day)  Also want some more tips on making my eyes pop.   I may give fake lashes a try too.","Attachments":[],"Id":1868562,"PostDate":1408922873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lia33, on 24 August 2014 - 03:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> If you're worried about flawless photo skin, I'm sure worse comes to worse with editing from the photographer your skin will be amazing regardless! lol Even during my impromptu engagement photos my skin was flawless with nothing but my regular make up routine.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm planning on using the resort spa - hair and make-up day of wedding is part of my package. I was sent some photos of the work done and it seems to be pretty good. My fianc\u00e9 is also really big on me looking like \"me\". I plan to look like me but also don't want to look like I did nothing out of the norm to myself...I would like a touch of glamour! I think it's a great idea to go somewhere to get tips, I may do the same just in case. My moh is also pretty good at doing make up and will likely take care of the bridesmaids. Hoping the trial hair run will be good! \u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have sun spots which I am sure are going to be front and centre in that heat!! \u00a0So a good foundation will be high on my list. \u00a0If I can achieve the look thru someone showing me at MAC then I am all for that. \u00a0I want to look myself too, but I also want a bit more than my normal routine (ie I NEVER wear lipstick but will for my wedding day) \u00a0Also want some more tips on making my eyes pop. \u00a0 I may give fake lashes a try too.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b71e89f0f276052b35472325a283b1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] &amp;nbsp;I think my fianc\u00e9 will like how I look with lashes but wouldn&#039;t want him to dislike it as he has made it clear he wants me to look natural lol He saw pics from a wedding I went to in the past - and said he didn&#039;t like my hair or makeup for it....he said this almost a year after the wedding though lol I had loved my hair and make up! So I I agree though, I want to look like myself but with a bang. I don&#039;t want the guests at my wedding to have a better make up job than me!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868568,"PostDate":1408924105,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I think my fianc\u00e9 will like how I look with lashes but wouldn't want him to dislike it as he has made it clear he wants me to look natural lol He saw pics from a wedding I went to in the past - and said he didn't like my hair or makeup for it....he said this almost a year after the wedding though lol I had loved my hair and make up! So I I agree though, I want to look like myself but with a bang. I don't want the guests at my wedding to have a better make up job than me!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406480117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7d4ec7590aba9927e62677297fecca5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;all good ideas ladies! I would definitely recommend a trial if you are having a friend or BP member do it for you. OH and have them write down the products they used (eye shadow color, lipstick, etc.) that way on the big day they know exactly which direction to head in.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868771,"PostDate":1408989329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>all good ideas ladies! I would definitely recommend a trial if you are having a friend or BP member do it for you. OH and have them write down the products they used (eye shadow color, lipstick, etc.) that way on the big day they know exactly which direction to head in.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361741426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5affc097fa709ae49a0b67d20e81a39e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Is there anyone who has come across a wedding at the Sandos Finisterra in Cabo who has used the hotel&#039;s hair and makeup services? It is included in my package but won&#039;t get there until 2 days before the wedding so kind of hard to plan if it is a disaster...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868783,"PostDate":1408990570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Is there anyone who has come across a wedding at the Sandos Finisterra in Cabo who has used the hotel's hair and makeup services? It is included in my package but won't get there until 2 days before the wedding so kind of hard to plan if it is a disaster...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"holly_youngquist@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399573622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hyoungquist","Id":277896,"Name":"hyoungquist","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"520235d2d408623a1ab843ba2c962bb5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hyoungquist\" post=\"1868783\" timestamp=\"1408986970\"]\nIs there anyone who has come across a wedding at the Sandos Finisterra in Cabo who has used the hotel&#039;s hair and makeup services? It is included in my package but won&#039;t get there until 2 days before the wedding so kind of hard to plan if it is a disaster...[\/quote]Not for cabo but in Mayan I do. My friend married there and loved her hair. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1868795,"PostDate":1408992736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hyoungquist, on 25 August 2014 - 10:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Is there anyone who has come across a wedding at the Sandos Finisterra in Cabo who has used the hotel's hair and makeup services? It is included in my package but won't get there until 2 days before the wedding so kind of hard to plan if it is a disaster...<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nNot for cabo but in Mayan I do. My friend married there and loved her hair. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"125e37213b889c6bee8351a35ed46f6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] do you have pictures you could send me or a photographers website? I would think they would hold the same standards for all resorts.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868801,"PostDate":1408993666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> do you have pictures you could send me or a photographers website? I would think they would hold the same standards for all resorts.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"holly_youngquist@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399573622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hyoungquist","Id":277896,"Name":"hyoungquist","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77867,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d842964ab092ec5297ebd08cb1ecaee","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hyoungquist\" post=\"1868801\" timestamp=\"1408990066\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] do you have pictures you could send me or a photographers website? I would think they would hold the same standards for all resorts.[\/quote]Hmmm I could ask her to send me a picture. We aren&#039;t on Facebook so I can&#039;t snoop. Not sure which photographer she used. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1868885,"PostDate":1409012862,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hyoungquist, on 25 August 2014 - 11:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> do you have pictures you could send me or a photographers website? I would think they would hold the same standards for all resorts.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nHmmm I could ask her to send me a picture. We aren't on Facebook so I can't snoop. Not sure which photographer she used. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread 